279,species,Anseriformes,Anatidae,"Ducks, Swans, and Geese",Oxyura vittata,"(Philippi, RA, 1860)",Archiv für Naturgeschichte 26 p.26,Lake Duck,Lake Duck,Lake Duck,,,breeds southern Argentina and Chile; winters northward to southern Brazil and Paraguay,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22679824,lakduc1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/lakduc1/,avibase-079A8245,,,Chile.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/48718#page/34/mode/1up,Erismatura vittata
280,species,Anseriformes,Anatidae,"Ducks, Swans, and Geese",Oxyura jamaicensis,"(Gmelin, JF, 1789)","Systema Naturae. Editio decima tertia, aucta, reformata. Cura Jo. Frid. Gmelin (etc.). Tomus I. Pars II 1 pt2 p.519",Ruddy Duck,,,52,"Taxa ferruginea and andina are treated as subspecies of Oxyura jamaicensis based on available evidence. Although ferruginea and nominate jamaicensis are phenotypically distinct, low mitochondrial DNA divergence (McCracken & Sorenson 2005) and shared haplotypes occur (Lozano-Jaramillo et al. 2018). Furthermore, the geographically intermediate taxon, andina, is of hybrid origin (Adams & Slavid 1984; Fjeldså 1986; McCracken & Sorenson 2005, Muñoz-Fuentes et al. 2013; Donegan et al. 2015; Lozano-Jaramillo et al. 2018), suggesting that all three are best treated as conspecific pending further research.",,,NE,,,,avibase-DF1E2A1D,,,Jamaica.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/10286#page/20/mode/1up,Anas jamaicensis
281,subspecies,Anseriformes,Anatidae,"Ducks, Swans, and Geese",Oxyura jamaicensis jamaicensis,"(Gmelin, JF, 1789)","Systema Naturae. Editio decima tertia, aucta, reformata. Cura Jo. Frid. Gmelin (etc.). Tomus I. Pars II 1 pt2 p.519",,,,,,interior northwestern North America (southwestern Canada to Mexico); West Indies,,,,rudduc,,avibase-675EEA7F,,,Jamaica.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/10286#page/20/mode/1up,Anas jamaicensis
