629,species,Galliformes,Megapodiidae,Megapodes,Megapodius freycinet,"Gaimard, JP, 1823",Bulletin Général et Universel des Annonces et de Nouvelles Scientifiques 2 p.451,Dusky Megapode,Dusky Megapode,Dusky Scrubfowl,109,"Taxon forsteni (polytypic, including buruensis) is treated as conspecific with Megapodius freycinet (polytypic) based on available evidence. Although the M. freycinet sensu lato complex is phenotypically variable, differences are mostly in size, and in shading of plumage and bare parts (Eaton et al. 2021); genetic divergences based on mitochondrial (Birks & Edwards 2002) and multilocus DNA data (Harris et al. 2014b) are also small. Further research will be needed to determine species limits in this complex.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22678602,dusscr1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/dusscr1/,avibase-D3A0B18E,,,Waigeu and Boni Islands,"892. Mémoire sur un nouveau genre de Gallinacés, établi sous le nom de Mégapode, lu à la Soc. d'hist. nat. de Paris le 6 juin 1823, par M. Gaimard, membre correspondant de cette société, etc..",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/25875#page/457/mode/1up,Megapodius freycinet
