758,species,Galliformes,Cracidae,"Guans, Curassows, and Chachalacas",Ortalis squamata,"Lesson, RP, 1829","Dictionnaire des sciences naturelles, dans lequel on traite méthodiquement des différens êtres de la nature, considérés soit en eux-mêmes, d'après l'état actuel de nos connoissances, soit relativement à l'utilité qu'en peuvent retirer la médecine, l'agriculture, le commerce et les arts. Suivi d'une biographie des plus célèbres naturalistes ...Par plusieurs professeurs du Jardin du Roi, et des principales écoles de Paris 59 p.195",Scaled Chachalaca,Scaled Chachalaca,Scaled Chachalaca,706,"Taxon remota is treated as a subspecies of Ortalis guttata based on available evidence. Sometimes treated as a subspecies of O. squamata, although Silveira et al. (2017) further proposed remota be recognised as a full species on the basis of differences in plumage and bare part color. As plumage traits appear to align remota more closely to O. guttata, it is placed there pending further research including genetic data.",southeastern Brazil,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/155246763,specha4,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/specha4/,avibase-407F8A84,,,"South America: type is from the State of Santa Catharina, Brazil.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/81599#page/201/mode/1up,Ortalida squamata
