1237,species,Galliformes,Phasianidae,"Partridges, Pheasants, Grouse, and Allies",Phasianus versicolor,"Vieillot, LJP, 1825",La Galerie des Oiseaux du Cabinet d'Histoire Naturelle du Jardin du Roi (etc.) 2 p.23 pl.205,Green Pheasant,Green Pheasant,Green Pheasant,125,"Taxon versicolor (polytypic) is treated as a species separate from Phasianus colchicus (polytypic) based on reproductive behavior and genetics. Although the two species hybridize, post-zygotic selection against hybrids (Brazil 1991) or genetic swamping (McCarthy 2006) appears to operate. Nuclear and mitochondrial DNA also show levels of divergence similar to other species pairs of pheasants (Liu et al. 2020b).",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22732650,rinphe2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/rinphe2/,avibase-22C500C0,,,"Java, error = Japan.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/271542#page/48/mode/1up,Phasianus versicolor
