2593,species,Columbiformes,Columbidae,Doves and Pigeons,Nesoenas mayeri,"(Prévost, F, 1843)","Les Pigeons [Knip & Prévost] ed.2, 2 p.113, pl.60",Pink Pigeon,Pink Pigeon,,65,"Extinct taxon duboisi is treated as a subspecies of Nesoenas mayeri based on available evidence. Known only from a single subfossil humerus, mensural analysis (Mourer-Chauviré et al. 1999) shows it to fall within the range of mayeri for all traits except length, which is only slightly longer.",,,NE,,pinpig2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/pinpig2/,avibase-469B7EC8,,,Mauritius.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/210838#page/125/mode/1up,Columba Mayeri
