3162,species,Columbiformes,Columbidae,Doves and Pigeons,Ptilinopus chrysogaster,"Gray, GR, 1854","Proceedings of the Zoological Society of London pt.21, no.250 p.48 pl.54",Raiatea Fruit Dove,Raiatea Fruit-Dove,Raiatea Fruit-dove,419,"Taxon chrysogaster is treated as a monotypic species separate from Ptilinopus purpuratus (polytypic) based on genetic evidence. An analysis dominated by mitochondrial DNA data (Cibois et al. 2014) placed chrysogaster as a sister taxon to P. rarotongensis with strong support, suggesting chrysogaster may not be part of the purpuratus group. However, genetic divergences between all three species are relatively shallow; further clarification from genomic DNA may be needed to better resolve species limits in this group.","western Society Islands (Bora Bora, Tahaa, Huahine, and Maupiti)",,EN,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/60760066,gygfrd2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/gygfrd2/,avibase-94543CFF,,,"'Probably from Tahiti' = Raiatea, Society Islands, designated by Murphy, Am. Mus. Novit., no. 115, p. 6.",Descriptions of Two New Species of Ptilonopus.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/96679#page/76/mode/1up,Ptilonopus chrysogaster
3163,species,Columbiformes,Columbidae,Doves and Pigeons,Ptilinopus purpuratus,"(Gmelin, JF, 1789)","Systema Naturae. Editio decima tertia, aucta, reformata. Cura Jo. Frid. Gmelin (etc.). Tomus I. Pars II 1 pt2 p.784",Grey-green Fruit Dove,Gray-green Fruit-Dove,Grey-green Fruit-dove,419,"Taxon chrysogaster is treated as a monotypic species separate from Ptilinopus purpuratus (polytypic) based on genetic evidence. An analysis dominated by mitochondrial DNA data (Cibois et al. 2014) placed chrysogaster as a sister taxon to P. rarotongensis with strong support, suggesting chrysogaster may not be part of the purpuratus group. However, genetic divergences between all three species are relatively shallow; further clarification from genomic DNA may be needed to better resolve species limits in this group.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/60759996,gygfrd1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/gygfrd1/,avibase-68341502,,,"Tahiti, based on Latham, Syn., 2, p. 626, no. 15.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/10286#page/285/mode/1up,Columba purpurata
