3621,subspecies,Gruiformes,Rallidae,"Rails, Gallinules, and Coots",Rufirallus schomburgkii chapmani,"(Naumburg, EMB, 1930)",Bulletin of the American Museum of Natural History 60 p.72,,,,,,"southeastern Ecuador, eastern Peru through southern and central Brazil to far northeastern Argentina (Misiones); subspecies attributions of some areas unclear",,,,ocecra3,,avibase-70082365,,,"Morinho de Lyra, Matto Grosso, Brazil.","Birds of Mato Grosso, Brazil. A report on the Birds secured by the Roosevelt-Rondon Expedition. With field notes by G. K. Cherrie.",https://digitallibrary.amnh.org/handle/2246/1182,Thyrorhina schomburgki chapmani
3622,species,Gruiformes,Rallidae,"Rails, Gallinules, and Coots",Rufirallus viridis,"(Müller, PLS, 1776)",Des Ritters Carl von Linné ... vollständigen Natursystems Supplements- und Register-Band über alle sechs Theile oder Classen des Thierreichs p.120,Russet-crowned Crake,Russet-crowned Crake,Russet-crowned Crake,,,,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22692323,ruccra1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/ruccra1/,avibase-4B5BBB61,,,"Cayenne, ex Daubenton, PL enl. no. 368.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/218386#page/140/mode/1up,Rallus viridis
