3849,species,Charadriiformes,Charadriidae,Plovers and Lapwings,Thinornis tricollaris,"(Vieillot, LJP, 1818)","Nouveau dictionnaire d'histoire naturelle, appliquée aux arts, à l'agriculture, à l'économie rurale et domestique, à la médecine, etc. Nouvelle édition 27 p.147",Three-banded Plover,Three-banded Plover,,910,Taxon bifrontatus is treated as a subspecies of Thinornis tricollaris based on available evidence. Although the two taxa differ in plumage and mitochondrial DNA (Dos Remedios et al. 2020) the levels are more consistent with subspecific differentiation. A more comprehensive analysis based on genomic DNA may be informative.,,,NE,,thbplo1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/thbplo1/,avibase-8DAF86A1,,,"Africa, restricted type locality. Cape Town, Grant, Ibis, 1915, p. 57.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/63927#page/161/mode/1up,Charadrius tricollaris
