3907,species,Charadriiformes,Charadriidae,Plovers and Lapwings,Anarhynchus veredus,"(Gould, J, 1848)","Proceedings of the Zoological Society of London pt.16, no.182 p.38",Oriental Plover,Oriental Plover,Oriental Plover,,,breeds inland eastern Asia from south-central Siberia and Mongolia to western Inner Mongolia (north-central China); winters inland and coastal Indonesia from Java to southern New Guinea and northern Australia,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22693872,oriplo1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/oriplo1/,avibase-02091964,,,Northern Australia.,On seven new species of Australian Birds.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/46216#page/60/mode/1up,Charadrius veredus
