4104,species,Charadriiformes,Scolopacidae,Sandpipers and Allies,Actitis macularius,"(Linnaeus, C, 1766)",Systema Naturæ. Editio duodecima reformata. Tomus I [part 1] p.249,Spotted Sandpiper,Spotted Sandpiper,Spotted Sandpiper,,,"breeds inland waterbody margins from Aleutian Islands and Alaska mainland except North Slope eastward through Canada (except far northern) to Newfoundland, and southward to southwestern and east-central USA; winters southern USA and Caribbean southward to northern Chile and Argentina",,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22693277,sposan,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/sposan/,avibase-0D88C072,,,"Europe and North America = Pennsylvania, ex reference to Edwards, pi. 277, f. 2.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/137337#page/253/mode/1up,Tringa macularia
