4110,species,Charadriiformes,Scolopacidae,Sandpipers and Allies,Tringa ochropus,"Linnaeus, C, 1758","Systema Naturæ per Regna Tria Naturæ, Secundum Classes, Ordines, Genera, Species, cum Characteribus, Differentiis, Synonymis, Locis. Tomus I. Editio decima, reformata 1 p.149",Green Sandpiper,Green Sandpiper,Green Sandpiper,,,"breeds taiga wetlands from Scandinavia and Germany eastward to Sakha Republic (northeastern Siberia), southward through central Asia and northeastern China; winters wetlands from British Isles southward through Africa and eastward to Japan through Philippines",,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22693243,grnsan,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/grnsan/,avibase-A7B17EFC,,,"Europe, restricted type locality, Sweden.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/10277#page/168/mode/1up,Tringa Ocrophus
