4485,species,Charadriiformes,Laridae,"Skimmers, Noddies, Terns, and Gulls",Thalasseus sandvicensis,"(Latham, J, 1787)",Supplement to the general synopsis of birds p.296,Sandwich Tern,Sandwich Tern,Sandwich Tern,915,"Taxon acuflavidus (polytypic, including eurygnathus) is treated as conspecific with Thalasseus sandvicensis based on available evidence. The apparent lack of vocal differences and complex patterns of phenotypic variation require further evaluation. Mitochondrial DNA data (Efe et al. 2009; Collinson et al. 2017) indicate paraphyly within T. sandvicensis but this might result from mtDNA capture as supporting genomic data are lacking. A comprehensive review of phenotypic and genetic variation in this complex is needed.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22694591,santer1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/santer1/,avibase-F7504353,,,"Sandwich, Kent, England, based on the Sandwich Tern, Gen. Syn., 5, p. 356.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/103199#page/334/mode/1up,Sterna sandvicensis
