4537,genus,Charadriiformes,Laridae,"Skimmers, Noddies, Terns, and Gulls",Hydrocoloeus,"Kaup, JJ, 1829",Skizzirte Entwickelungs-Geschichte und natürliches System der Europäischen Thierwelt (etc.) 1 p.113,,,,1145,"Seven genera are recognized among the Larus gulls based on phylogenetic information obtained from nuclear and mitochondrial DNA (Pons et al. 2005; Sternkopf 2011; Černý & Natale 2022): polytypic Chroicocephalus; monotypic Saundersilarus, Hydrocoloeus and Rhodostethia; polytypic Leucophaeus, Ichthyaetus, and Larus. Circumscription of genera follows IOC14.2 and Clements v2023.",,,,,,,,M,"Larus minutus [Pallas, 1776]; type by subsequent designation (Gray, GR, 1842, Appendix to a list of the Genera of Birds, p. 15).",,,,Hydrocoloeus
