4613,subspecies,Charadriiformes,Laridae,"Skimmers, Noddies, Terns, and Gulls",Larus argentatus argentatus,"Pontoppidan, E, 1763",Den Danske Atlas eller Konge-Riget Dannemark (etc.) 1 p.622,,,,,,breeds Scandinavia to Kola Peninsula (northwestern Russia); winters northern and western Europe,,,,hergul2,,avibase-51E94F21,,,"No type locality' = Christiansoe, ex Brunnich, Orn. Boreal., 1764, p. 44.",,,Larus Argentatus
