4741,species,Procellariiformes,Diomedeidae,Albatrosses,Thalassarche bulleri,"(Rothschild, LW, 1893)","Bulletin of the British Ornithologists' Club 1, no.10 p.58",Buller's Albatross,Buller's Albatross,Buller's Albatross,,,,,NT,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22728328,bulalb2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/bulalb2/,avibase-F79F09E1,,,New Zealand.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/101092#page/84/mode/1up,Diomedea bulleri
