4743,subspecies,Procellariiformes,Diomedeidae,Albatrosses,Thalassarche bulleri platei,"(Reichenow, A, 1898)",Ornithologische Monatsberichte 6 p.190,,,,,,"breeds Chatham Islands and Three Kings Islands (off North Island, New Zealand; very few); ranges across southern South Pacific (southern Australia to South America)",,,,bulalb3,,avibase-D4F49AF6,,,"Cavancha, Chile.",[Über eine von Hrn. Prof. Plate bei Cavancha in Chile gesammelte Diomedea].,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/101396#page/204/mode/1up,Diomedea platei
