4867,subspecies,Procellariiformes,Procellariidae,"Petrels, Shearwaters, and Diving Petrels",Puffinus puffinus canariensis,"Rodríguez, A; Rodríguez, B; Montelongo, T; Garcia-Porta, J; Pipa, T; Carty, M; Danielsen, J; Nunes, J; Silva, C; Geraldes, PL; Medina, FM; Illera, JC, 2020",Journal of Avian Biology 51 10.1111/jav.02633,,,,,,La Palma and Tenerife (Canary Islands),,,,manshe2,,avibase-3009BCF0,,,,Cryptic differentiation in the Manx shearwater hinders the identification of a new endemic subspecies,https://www.researchgate.net/publication/345830293,Puffinus puffinus canariensis
4868,species,Procellariiformes,Procellariidae,"Petrels, Shearwaters, and Diving Petrels",Puffinus yelkouan,"(Acerbi, G, 1827)",Biblioteca Italiana 47 p.297,Mediterranean Shearwater,,,772,"Taxon mauretanicus is treated as a subspecies of Puffinus yelkouan based on analysis of genomic data (Ferrer Obiol et al. 2021, 2023), supported by mitochondrial DNA (Genovart et al. 2005, 2012), and phenotypic data (Genovart et al. 2012). Both mitochondrial DNA and genomic data indicate relatively low levels of differentiation, comparable to, or lower than, reported for P. puffinus subspecies (Genovart et al. 2005; Rodríguez et al. 2020; Ferrer Obiol et al. 2023), and provide evidence of gene flow between mauretanicus and yelkouan; phenotypic traits also show evidence of intermediacy and admixture in mauretanicus (Genovart et al. 2012). Although assortative mating and distinct vocalizations have been reported (Curé et al. 2010), the available evidence is insufficient to confirm species-level differences.",,,NE,,medshe1,,avibase-192A4260,,,"the Bosphorus, opposite Bujukdere.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/33672#page/303/mode/1up,Procellaria Yelkouan
4869,subspecies,Procellariiformes,Procellariidae,"Petrels, Shearwaters, and Diving Petrels",Puffinus yelkouan yelkouan,"(Acerbi, G, 1827)",Biblioteca Italiana 47 p.297,,,,,,breeds central and eastern Mediterranean islands and western Black Sea; ranges throughout Mediterranean and Black Sea,,,,levshe1,,avibase-FD97EC1E,,,"the Bosphorus, opposite Bujukdere.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/33672#page/303/mode/1up,Procellaria Yelkouan
4870,subspecies,Procellariiformes,Procellariidae,"Petrels, Shearwaters, and Diving Petrels",Puffinus yelkouan mauretanicus,"Lowe, PR, 1921","Bulletin of the British Ornithologists' Club 41, no.259 p.140",,,,,,breeds islets in Balearic Islands; ranges to Atlantic coasts of southwestern Europe and northwestern Africa,,,,balshe1,,avibase-42F573C7,,,Algiers.,Description of a new race of Shearwater from the western end of the Mediterranean.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/100930#page/171/mode/1up,Puffinus puffinus mauretanicus
4871,species,Procellariiformes,Procellariidae,"Petrels, Shearwaters, and Diving Petrels",Puffinus lherminieri,"Lesson, RP, 1839","Revue Zoologique, par la Société Cuvierienne 2 p.102",Sargasso Shearwater,Sargasso Shearwater,,889,"Taxa boydi and baroli are treated as species separate from Puffinus lherminieri based on a combination of morphological, genomic (Ferrer Obiol et al. 2021, 2022), and multilocus DNA data (Torres et al. 2021). Although morphological characters align boydi with lherminieri, all genetic studies recover boydi and the distinctive-looking baroli as sister taxa, thus supporting a 3-species treatment.",,,NE,,audshe,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/audshe/,avibase-06C36D41,,,"Antilles; Saint Barthélemy, Guadeloupe, West Indies (Olson, 2013)","Description de treize oiseaux nouveaux, suivies de rectifications sur quelques espèces déjà publiées.",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/19515#page/110/mode/1up,Pufflnus Lherminieri
4872,subspecies,Procellariiformes,Procellariidae,"Petrels, Shearwaters, and Diving Petrels",Puffinus lherminieri lherminieri,"Lesson, RP, 1839","Revue Zoologique, par la Société Cuvierienne 2 p.102",,,,,,"breeds locally in northern Caribbean, on islets of Bahamas, off northern Cuba, east of Puerto Rico, the Lesser Antilles, and Providencia; formerly Bermuda",,,,audshe1,,avibase-962D6C7A,,,"Antilles; Saint Barthélemy, Guadeloupe, West Indies (Olson, 2013)","Description de treize oiseaux nouveaux, suivies de rectifications sur quelques espèces déjà publiées.",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/19515#page/110/mode/1up,Pufflnus Lherminieri
