4907,species,Procellariiformes,Procellariidae,"Petrels, Shearwaters, and Diving Petrels",Pelecanoides georgicus,"Murphy, RC; Harper, F, 1916",Bulletin of the American Museum of Natural History 35 p.66,South Georgia Diving Petrel,South Georgia Diving-Petrel,,894,"Taxon whenuahouensis is treated as a subspecies of Pelecanoides georgicus based on available evidence. Plumage differences are subtle, morphological traits considered diagnostic show considerable variation within taxa (Fischer et al. 2018), and mitochondrial DNA divergence is low (Grosser et al. 2021).",,,NE,,sgdpet1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/sgdpet1/,avibase-1838EC86,,,"Cumberland Bay, South Georgia.",Two new Diving Petrels.,https://digitallibrary.amnh.org/handle/2246/1843,Pelecanoides georgica
