4929,species,Procellariiformes,Procellariidae,"Petrels, Shearwaters, and Diving Petrels",Pterodroma mollis,"(Gould, J, 1844)","The Annals and Magazine of Natural History including Zoology, Botany, and Geology ser.1, vol.13, no.85 p.363",Soft-plumaged Petrel,Soft-plumaged Petrel,Soft-plumaged Petrel,,,"breeds subtropical to subantarctic islands of South Indian and South Atlantic oceans, from Tristan da Cunha and Gough to Maatsuyker (off Tasmania), Macquarie Island (southeast of Australia), and Antipodes Islands (south of New Zealand); ranges to southern waters off Australasia, Africa, and South America",,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22698080,soppet1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/soppet1/,avibase-12286A1E,,,South Atlantic Ocean.,"XLIII. On the Family Procellaridae, with descriptions of Ten new Species.",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/19482#page/393/mode/1up,Procellaria mollis
