5262,genus,Pelecaniformes,Ardeidae,"Herons, Egrets, and Bitterns",Botaurus,"Stephens, JF, 1819","General Zoology, or systematic natural history 11, pt2 p.592",,,,1205,"Ixobrychus is merged into Botaurus pending further research to confirm generic and subgeneric limits in this complex. Genetic evidence from genomic (Hruska et al. 2023) and mitochondrial DNA data (Päckert et al. 2014) indicate that Ixobrychus is not a monophyletic group; both exilis and involucris are aligned with Botaurus despite plumage, size, and vocalizations suggesting they form a clade with B. [I]. minutus.",,,,,,,,M,"Ardea stellaris [Linnaeus, 1758]; type by subsequent designation (Gray, GR, 1840, A List of the Genera of Birds, p. 66).",,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/113478#page/420/mode/1up,Botaurus
