6094,species,Apodiformes,Apodidae,Swifts,Aerodramus infuscatus,"(Salvadori, AT, 1880)",Atti della R[eale] Accademia delle Scienze di Torino 15 p.348,Moluccan Swiftlet,Moluccan Swiftlet,Moluccan Swiftlet,948,"Taxa sororum and ceramensis are treated as subspecies of Aerodramus infuscatus pending publication of ongoing genomic research. Sometimes split based on differences in rump color and pattern (Rheindt & Hutchinson 2007) but the taxonomic significance of plumage variation in Aerodramus swiftlets is unclear. Although mitochondrial DNA data (Cibois et al. 2018a) align sororum with the fuciphagus-salangana group of species, ceramensis and infuscatus were not included in the study.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22686522,,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/molswi5/,avibase-90683CCB,,,Ternate.,,https://books.google.ca/books?id=LhYQkT0mjEcC&pg=PA348,Collocalia infuscata
