6129,species,Apodiformes,Apodidae,Swifts,Aerodramus amelis,"(Oberholser, HC, 1906)","Proceedings of the Academy of Natural Sciences of Philadelphia 58 p.180,193",Ameline Swiftlet,Ameline Swiftlet,,947,"Taxon amelis (polytypic, including palawanensis) is treated as a species separate from Aerodramus vanikorensis based, in part, on mitochondrial DNA data (Price et al. 2005; Cibois et al. 2018a) that recovered vanikorensis as polyphyletic. Although nominate amelis has not been sampled, taxon palawanensis is not part of the vanikorensis clade centred in the Bismarck and Solomon archipelagos. Publication of ongoing genomic research should provide additional insights on species limits in this group.",,,NE,,palswi2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/palswi2/,avibase-6F1B12CA,,,"Irisan, Benguet, Luzon.",A monograph of the genus Collocalia.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/30129#page/190/mode/1up,Collocalia unicolor amelis
