6131,subspecies,Apodiformes,Apodidae,Swifts,Aerodramus amelis palawanensis,"(Stresemann, EFT, 1914)",Verhandlungen der Ornithologischen Gesellschaft in Bayern 12 Heft1 p.10,,,,,,Palawan (southwestern Philippines),,,,ameswi2,,avibase-6196B934,,,"Puerto Princesa, Palawan.",Was ist Collocalia fuciphaga (Thunb.) ?.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/101551#page/46/mode/1up,Collocalia lowi palawanensis
6132,species,Apodiformes,Apodidae,Swifts,Aerodramus vanikorensis,"(Quoy, JRC; Gaimard, JP, 1832)","Voyage de découvertes de la corvette l'Astrolabe, exécuté par ordre du Roi, pendant les années 1826-1827-1828-1829, sous le commandement de M. J. Dumont d'Urville (etc.). Zoologie. Vol. 1 1 p.206 AtlasOis. pl.12 fig.3",Uniform Swiftlet,Uniform Swiftlet,,"947, 1181","947)) Taxon amelis (polytypic, including palawanensis) is treated as a species separate from Aerodramus vanikorensis based, in part, on mitochondrial DNA data (Price et al. 2005; Cibois et al. 2018a) that recovered vanikorensis as polyphyletic. Although nominate amelis has not been sampled, taxon palawanensis is not part of the vanikorensis clade centred in the Bismarck and Solomon archipelagos. Publication of ongoing genomic research should provide additional insights on species limits in this group. 1181)) Taxon orientalis (polytypic, including leletensis) is treated as a species separate from Aerodramus vanikorensis based on available evidence. However, traits used to diagnose A. orientalis (tarsal feathering, pale rump, and gloss) appear to be present in some populations of A. vanikorensis (Tarburton 2018); genetic data will be needed to determine species limits in this complex.",,,NE,,uniswi1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/uniswi1/,avibase-4ADF31A6,,,Island of Vanikoro.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/18512#page/264/mode/1up,Hirundo vanikorensis
