6440,species,Apodiformes,Trochilidae,Hummingbirds,Coeligena violifer,"(Gould, J, 1846)","Proceedings of the Zoological Society of London pt.14, no.164 p.87",Violet-throated Starfrontlet,Violet-throated Starfrontlet,,292,"The monotypic taxa dichroura, albicaudata, and osculans are treated as subspecies of Coeligena violifer based on available evidence. Differences in plumage do not provide clear taxonomic indications, although the lack of a ""starfrontlet"" in violifer may be significant. Mitochondrial DNA data (Parra et al. 2009) show divergence of violifer from dichroura at subspecies level, but data for albicaudata and osculans are lacking; further research needed.",,,NE,,vitsta1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/vitsta1/,avibase-FA738B33,,,"Sandillani Road, Yungas, Bolivia.",On twenty new species of Trochilidae or Humming Birds.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/46217#page/455/mode/1up,Trochilus (--?) violifer
