6558,species,Apodiformes,Trochilidae,Hummingbirds,Heliangelus clarisse,"(de Longuemare, G, 1841)","Revue Zoologique, par la Société Cuvierienne 4 p.306",Longuemare's Sunangel,Longuemare's Sunangel,Longuemare's Sunangel,286,Heliangelus amethysticollis sensu lato is treated as three species based on substantial differences in vocalizations (Donegan et al. 2015) and consistent variation in plumage characters (color and size of frons): H. amethysticollis (polytypic); H. spencei (monotypic); and H. clarisse (polytypic). Genetic data are limited and fragmentary (Altshuler et al. 2004; McGuire et al. 2014; Ornelas et al. 2014); further research needed.,,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/60859989,amtsun2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/amtsun2/,avibase-7AA56690,,,"Bogota, Colombia.",Oiseau-mouche nouveau.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/19646#page/314/mode/1up,Ornismya clarisse
