6817,species,Apodiformes,Trochilidae,Hummingbirds,Riccordia bracei,"(Lawrence, GN, 1877)",Annals of the New York Academy of Sciences 1 no.1&2 p.50,Brace's Emerald,Brace's Emerald,Brace's Emerald,308,"Taxon elegans is removed from Riccordia bracei and treated as a taxon of uncertain status pending further research. Described from a single specimen of uncertain provenance, elegans differs from bracei in morphology (Weller 1999) and should not be considered conspecific. However, genetic data are needed to accurately assign species status.","formerly northern Bahamas; extinct, last reported 1877",Extinct,EX,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22687333,braeme2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/braeme2/,avibase-10787A38,,,"New Providence, Bahama Islands.",Descriptions of new species of birds of the families Trochilidae and Tetraonidae. Annals of the New York Academy of,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/109884#page/82/mode/1up,Sporadinus Bracei
