7008,species,Apodiformes,Trochilidae,Hummingbirds,Saucerottia hoffmanni,"(Cabanis, JL; Heine, F, 1860)",Museum Heineanum. Verzeichniss der orithologischen Sammlung des Oberamtmann Ferdinand Heine 3 p.38,Blue-vented Hummingbird,Blue-vented Hummingbird,,295,"Taxon hoffmanni is treated as a monotypic species separate from Saucerottia saucerottei (polytypic) based on genetics and vocalizations. Combined analysis of nuclear and mitochondrial DNA data (McGuire et al. 2014) did not recover S. saucerottei sensu lato as monophyletic, a pattern consistent with reports that saucerottei and hoffmanni differ strikingly in voice and behavior (Stiles & Skutch 1989). Further research is needed to determine if hoffmanni is conspecific with S. beryllina or S. cyanura (see Jiménez & Ornelas 2016).",semiarid western Nicaragua to central Costa Rica,,NE,,buvhum1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/buvhum1/,avibase-0595E528,,,Costa Rica.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/196118#page/46/mode/1up,Hemithylaca Hoffmanni
