7770,species,Strigiformes,Strigidae,Owls,Megascops petersoni,"(Fitzpatrick, JW; O'Neill, JP, 1986)","Wilson Bulletin 98, no.1 p.1-14,front.",Cinnamon Screech Owl,Cinnamon Screech-Owl,Cinnamon Screech-owl,,,cloud forest of southern Ecuador to northern Peru,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22688840,cinsco1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/cinsco1/,avibase-C2937B68,,,,"Otus petersoni, a new species of screech-owl from the eastern Andes, with systematic notes on O. columbianus and O. ingens.",https://sora.unm.edu/sites/default/files/journals/wilson/v098n01/p0001-p0014.pdf,Otus petersoni
