7982,genus,Accipitriformes,Accipitridae,"Kites, Old World Vultures, Eagles, and Hawks",Neophron,"de Savigny, MJCL, 1809","Description de l'Égypte, ou recueil des observations et des recherches qui ont été faites en Égypte pendant l'expédition de l'armée française. Histoire naturelle. Vol. 1 1 pt1 livr.1 p.68,75",,,,N-73,"The gender of Neophron has long been controversial because the entry in the ICZN’s Official List from 1987 stipulated a feminine gender while the previous ICZN Direction 26 from 1955 fixed it as masculine. The entry in the Official List was an error. In 2024/2025, the ICZN issued an Official Correction that establishes the gender as masculine.",,,,,,,,M,"Vultur percnopterus [Linnaeus, 1758]; type by monotypy",,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/128879#page/80/mode/1up,Neophron
