8907,family,Bucerotiformes,Bucerotidae,Hornbills,Bucerotidae,,,,,,1177,"Bucorvus is placed in Bucerotidae rather than Bucorvidae based on available mitochondrial and nuclear DNA data (Viseshakul et al. 2011; Gonzalez et al. 2013), and obvious morphological affinities with other hornbills. Although forming a divergent clade, Bucorvus was recovered as part of a basal polytomy by Viseshakul et al. (2011), and clade ages may be substantially over-estimated.",,,,,,,,,,,,,
