9116,species,Coraciiformes,Meropidae,Bee-eaters,Merops viridissimus,"Swainson, WJ, 1837",The natural history of the birds of Western Africa 2 p.82,African Green Bee-eater,African Green Bee-eater,African Green Bee-eater,265,"Merops orientalis sensu lato is treated as three polytypic species based on differences in plumage: M. orientalis; M. viridissimus; and M. cyanophrys. Mitochondrial DNA COI barcodes (Khan et al. 2010; Schindel et al. 2011) support separation of orientalis and cyanophrys, but data for viridissimus are not available. Vocalizations have not been analyzed.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22725888,grnbee1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/grnbee1/,avibase-0AAA530E,,,Senegal.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/57925#page/96/mode/1up,Merops viridissimus
