9264,species,Coraciiformes,Alcedinidae,Kingfishers,Ceyx cyanopectus,"de Lafresnaye, NFAA, 1840","Revue Zoologique, par la Société Cuvierienne 3 p.33",Indigo-banded Kingfisher,Indigo-banded Kingfisher,,246,"Taxon nigrirostris is treated as a subspecies of Ceyx cyanopectus based on available evidence. Although mitochondrial DNA data (Andersen et al. 2018) did not recover these as monophyletic, the placement of nigrirostris is uncertain due to issues of sequence length and quality. Differences in plumage and size are modest, and vocalizations have not been rigorously analyzed. Further research is warranted.",,,NE,,inbkin2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/inbkin2/,avibase-F7975DF0,,,"Type locality unknown = Luzon by designation of Bangs, Bull. Mus. Comp. Zool., 70, 1930, p. 207.",Sur une nouvelle espèce du genre Ceyx et sur le genre Scolopacinus du Prince Ch.-Luc. Bonaparte.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/48713#page/43/mode/1up,Ceyx cyano-pectus
