9288,species,Coraciiformes,Alcedinidae,Kingfishers,Ceyx melanurus,"(Kaup, JJ, 1848)",Verhandlungen des Naturhistorischen Vereins für das Großherzogthum Hessen und Umgebung Heft2 p.74,Philippine Dwarf Kingfisher,Philippine Dwarf-Kingfisher,,251,"Taxon mindanensis (monotypic) is treated as conspecific with Ceyx melanurus (polytypic) based on available evidence. Plumage differences are minor, variation in morphology (size) is clinal, and divergence in mitochondrial DNA is relatively low (Andersen et al. 2013; Hosner et al. 2014). Nonetheless, the distinctiveness of mindanensis is supported by limited nuclear DNA data (Andersen et al. 2013, 2018); further research is warranted.",,,NE,,phikin1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/phikin1/,avibase-F0EEF2F8,,,Philippines.,,,Alcedo melanura
