9524,subspecies,Coraciiformes,Alcedinidae,Kingfishers,Todiramphus veneratus youngi,"Sharpe, RB, 1892",Catalogue of the birds in the British Museum 17 p.289,,,,,,Moorea (French Polynesia),,,,sockin1,,avibase-270BB45F,,,"Moorea, Society Islands.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/34362#page/303/mode/1up,Todirhamphus youngi
9525,species,Coraciiformes,Alcedinidae,Kingfishers,Todiramphus gambieri,"(Oustalet, J-FÉ, 1895)","Nouvelles Archives du Muséum d'Histoire Naturelle de Paris, Bulletin (3), 7 p.182",Tuamotu Kingfisher,Tuamotu Kingfisher,Tuamotu Kingfisher,262,"Taxon gertrudae is treated as a subspecies of Todiramphus gambieri based on available evidence. Although restricted to widely allopatric populations within the Tuamotus, the taxa differ only in minor plumage characters. Limited mitochondrial and nuclear DNA data place gertrudae within the tutus complex of the Tuamotus, but DNA data for the unique type specimen of gambieri is lacking (Thibault & Cibois 2017); further genetic research is warranted.",,,CR,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22683499,tuakin2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/tuakin2/,avibase-C7C7C1AE,,,"Mangareva, Gambier Archipelago, Tuamotus.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/121477#page/200/mode/1up,Halcyon Gambieri
