9675,species,Galbuliformes,Bucconidae,Puffbirds,Nystalus maculatus,"(Gmelin, JF, 1788)","Systema Naturae. Editio decima tertia, aucta, reformata. Cura Jo. Frid. Gmelin (etc.). Tomus I [pars I] p.451",Spot-backed Puffbird,Spot-backed Puffbird,Spot-backed Puffbird,270,"Taxon striatipectus (monotypic) is treated as a subspecies of Nystalus maculatus based on available evidence. Plumage differences (da Silva 1991) appear minor and inconsistent, a formal bioacoustic analysis is lacking, and divergence in mitochondrial DNA (Duarte 2015) and genomic data (Ferreira 2018) seems modest; further research needed.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22682270,spbpuf1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/spbpuf1/,avibase-B591C29D,,,Brazil.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/10285#page/463/mode/1up,Alcedo maculata
