9739,species,Galbuliformes,Bucconidae,Puffbirds,Hypnelus bicinctus,"(Gould, J, 1837)","Proceedings of the Zoological Society of London pt.4, no.45 p.80",Two-banded Puffbird,Two-banded Puffbird,Two-banded Puffbird,271,"Taxon bicinctus (polytypic, including stoicus) is treated as a species separate from Hypnelus ruficollis (polytypic) based on differences in plumage and vocalizations (Donegan et al. 2015). While hybridization appears limited, further research is needed to assess clinality and behavioral responses; genetic data are limited (Ferreira 2018).",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/61999682,rutpuf3,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/rutpuf3/,avibase-7E41141D,,,Cayenne? i.e. Venezuela.,Characters of some new species of Birds belonging to the genera Tamatia and Cursorius.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/96163#page/94/mode/1up,Tamatia bicincta
