9852,genus,Piciformes,Lybiidae,African Barbets,Trachylaemus,"Reichenow, A, 1891",Berichte Allgemeine Deutsche Ornithologische Gesellschaft zu Berlin p.3,,,,1230,"Taxa goffinii and purpuratus are placed in Trachylaemus, rather than Trachyphonus, based on differences in plumage and ecology, supported by divergence in mitochondrial-dominated DNA data (Moyle 2004).",,,,,,,,M,"Trachylaemus purpuratus [J. & E. Verreaux, 1851]; type by subsequent designation (Reichenow, 1903, Die Vögel Afrikas, 3, p. 159)",,,,Trachylaemus
9853,species,Piciformes,Lybiidae,African Barbets,Trachylaemus purpuratus,"(Verreaux, JP; Verreaux, JBÉ, 1851)","Revue et Magasin de Zoologie Pure et Appliquée (2), 3 p.260",Eastern Yellow-billed Barbet,Eastern Yellow-billed Barbet,Eastern Yellow-billed Barbet,675,"Taxon goffinii (polytypic, including togoensis) is treated as a species separate from Trachylaemus purpuratus based on plumage, facial bare parts color, and genetics. Deep mitochondrial DNA divergence (Moyle 2004) supports recognition of an eastern (purpuratus) and western clade but it is unclear if the western sample represented goffinii or togoensis. Pending further genetic research incorporating broader taxon sampling, togoensis is treated as a subspecies of T. goffinii.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22725980,yebbar5,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/yebbar5/,avibase-80BC978E,,,Gaboon.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/19559#page/278/mode/1up,Trachyphonus lurpuratus (sic: purpuratus)
