9887,species,Piciformes,Lybiidae,African Barbets,Stactolaema leucotis,"(Sundevall, CJ, 1850)","Öfversigt af Kongliga Vetenskaps-Akademiens Förhandlingar 7, no.4 p.109",White-eared Barbet,White-eared Barbet,,679,"Taxon leucogrammica (monotypic) is treated as a subspecies of Stactolaema leucotis based on available evidence. Plumage differences are comparable to those between nominate leucotis and kilimensis and there is a lack of additional evidence (ecological or behavioral) for considering there to be more than a single species in this complex; however, genetic data would be informative given that the Uluguru Mountains are a known centre of endemism.",,,NE,,whebar1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/whebar1/,avibase-6C81D39B,,,Lower Caifraria i.e. Natal.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/285379#page/119/mode/1up,Megalaema leucotis
