9903,species,Piciformes,Lybiidae,African Barbets,Gymnobucco bonapartei,"Hartlaub, KJG, 1854","Journal für Ornithologie 2, no.11 p.410",Grey-throated Barbet,Gray-throated Barbet,,677,"Taxon cinereiceps (monotypic) is treated as a subspecies of Gymnobucco bonapartei, as the evidentiary basis for a split is weak. The distributions of bonapartei and cinereiceps appear to be continuous, with a cline of increasing size eastwards, and a broad hybrid zone. Although differences in iris color occur (Chapin 1939) there is no evidence of behavioral, ecological, or genetic differences to support species status.",,,NE,,gytbar1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/gytbar1/,avibase-95054CA5,,,Gaboon.,Beiträge zur exotischen Ornithologie.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/49195#page/1046/mode/1up,Gymnobucco Bonapartei
