9985,species,Piciformes,Lybiidae,African Barbets,Lybius leucocephalus,"(de Filippi, F, 1853)","Revue et Magasin de Zoologie Pure et Appliquée (2), 5 p.291",White-headed Barbet,White-headed Barbet,,683,"The monotypic taxa leucogaster and senex are treated as subspecies of Lybius leucocephalus based on available evidence. Although sometimes split as separate species, plumage differences seem modest, ecologically the taxa are similar, and subspecies senex and albicauda are reported to interbreed (Short & Horne 1985a). Further evidence may show that the geographically isolated subspecies leucogaster warrants separation; further research needed.",,,NE,,whhbar1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/whhbar1/,avibase-BCA0F974,,,"Between 3° and 4° N. lat., White Nile.",Fragment d'une lettre de M. Ph. Defilippi à Son Altesse le prince Bonaparte.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/48709#page/313/mode/1up,Laimodon leucocephalus
