10116,species,Piciformes,Ramphastidae,Toucans,Aulacorhynchus albivitta,"(Boissonneau, A, 1840)","Revue Zoologique, par la Société Cuvierienne 3 p.70",Southern Emerald Toucanet,Southern Emerald-Toucanet,,939,"Taxa atrogularis (polytypic, including dimidiatus) and cyanolaemus are treated as conspecific with Aulacorhynchus albivitta pending further research. Sometimes split into 2 or 3 species based on plumage, bill color, and facial bare parts color. However, the proposed splits do not align with patterns of mitochondrial DNA divergence (Puebla-Olivares et al. 2008; Bonaccorso et al. 2011; Winker 2016), genetic data are lacking for some taxa, vocal differences remain poorly documented, and reports of hybridization and gene flow require more detailed study.",,,NE,,souemt1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/souemt1/,avibase-8E12984D,,,Bogota.,Oiseaux nouveaux de Santa-Fé de Bogota.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/48713#page/80/mode/1up,Pteroglossus albivitta
