10449,species,Piciformes,Picidae,Woodpeckers,Campethera tullbergi,"Sjöstedt, BY, 1892","Journal für Ornithologie 40, no.199 p.313",Tullberg's Woodpecker,Tullberg's Woodpecker,Tullberg's Woodpecker,783,"Taxon taeniolaema (polytypic, including hausburgi) is treated as a species separate from Campethera tullbergi based on pronounced differences in underparts plumage, supported by divergence in nuclear and mitochondrial DNA (Fuchs et al. 2017a). Vocalizations are poorly known and a formal bioacoustic analysis may be informative.",mountains of southeastern Nigeria and western Cameroon; Bioko Island,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22726364,tulwoo2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/tulwoo2/,avibase-D2718676,,,"Itoki Na N'Golo, Cameroons.",Neue Vogelarten von Kamerun.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/102240#page/327/mode/1up,Campothera Tullbergi
10450,species,Piciformes,Picidae,Woodpeckers,Campethera taeniolaema,"Reichenow, A; Neumann, OR, 1895",Ornithologische Monatsberichte 3 p.75,Fine-banded Woodpecker,Fine-banded Woodpecker,Fine-banded Woodpecker,783,"Taxon taeniolaema (polytypic, including hausburgi) is treated as a species separate from Campethera tullbergi based on pronounced differences in underparts plumage, supported by divergence in nuclear and mitochondrial DNA (Fuchs et al. 2017a). Vocalizations are poorly known and a formal bioacoustic analysis may be informative.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22726358,tulwoo3,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/tulwoo3/,avibase-D0A5FADB,,,"Guasso-Massai and Eldoma Station, Kenya Colony.","Diagnosen neuer, von Oskar Neumann in Ost- und Central-Afrika entdeckter Vogelarten.",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/35473#page/89/mode/1up,Campothera taeniolaema
