10528,species,Piciformes,Picidae,Woodpeckers,Celeus torquatus,"(Boddaert, P, 1783)",Table des planches enluminéez d'histoire naturelle de M. D'Aubenton p.52,Ringed Woodpecker,Ringed Woodpecker,,789,"Taxa occidentalis and tinnunculus are treated as subspecies of Celeus torquatus based on available evidence. Although phenotypic differences are present, intra-taxon variability in plumage and vocalizations, coupled with a poorly known hybrid zone between torquatus and occidentalis, indicates the need for further study, including genetics, before implementing any splits.",,,NE,,rinwoo1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/rinwoo1/,avibase-E07BFF55,,,"Cayenne, ex Daubenton, pi. 863.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/88617#page/74/mode/1up,Picus torquatus
