10602,species,Piciformes,Picidae,Woodpeckers,Colaptes rivolii,"(Boissonneau, A, 1840)","Revue Zoologique, par la Société Cuvierienne 3 p.36",Crimson-mantled Woodpecker,Crimson-mantled Woodpecker,,790,"Taxon atriceps is treated as a subspecies of Colaptes rivolii based on available evidence. Although plumage and vocal differences are present (Schulenberg et al. 2007), a putative hybrid zone of unknown width requires study before atriceps can be accepted as specifically distinct.",,,NE,,crmwoo2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/crmwoo2/,avibase-8947FC53,,,"No type locality; Chipaque, 9500 feet, 15 miles east of Bogota, designated by Chapman, 1917, p. 345.",Nouvelle espèce du genre Pic.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/48713#page/46/mode/1up,Picus Rivolii
