10644,species,Piciformes,Picidae,Woodpeckers,Colaptes rupicola,"d'Orbigny, ACVMD, 1840","Voyage dans l'Amérique Méridionale (le Brésil, la République Orientale de l'Uruguay, la République Argentine, la Patagonie, la République du Chili, la République de Bolivia, la République du Pérou), exécuté pendant les années 1826, 1827, 1828, 1829, 1830, 1831, 1832 et 1833 4 livr.51 pl.62 fig.1",Andean Flicker,Andean Flicker,,794,"Taxon cinereicapillus is treated as a subspecies of Colaptes rupicola based on available evidence. Plumages differ and vocal differences have been reported (Short 1982a), but a more comprehensive review of geographic patterns is needed to evaluate clinality and the extent of intergradation (Short 1972); genetic data would be informative.",,,NE,,andfli1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/andfli1/,avibase-12DFD1C8,,,"La Paz, Chuquisaca, Cochabamba and Potosi, Bolivia; type from Sicasica, fide Menegaux, Bull. Soc. Philom. Paris (10), 1, 1909, p. 207-208.)",,,Colaptes rupicola
