10762,species,Piciformes,Picidae,Woodpeckers,Melanerpes aurifrons,"(Wagler, JG, 1829)",Isis von Oken 22 col.512,Golden-fronted Woodpecker,Golden-fronted Woodpecker,Golden-fronted Woodpecker,799,"Taxon santacruzi (polytypic) is treated as conspecific with Melanerpes aurifrons based on genomic DNA evidence of monophyly and gene flow (Llanes-Quevedo et al. 2022). Sometimes treated as a separate species based on mitochondrial DNA data (García-Trejo et al. 2009) that placed nominate aurifrons as sister to M. carolinus, but Llanes-Quevedo et al. (2022) demonstrated that this is due to mtDNA artifacts. Further research is needed to determine species limits in this geographically variable complex.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22680862,gofwoo,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/gofwoo/,avibase-88C719E5,,,'Mexico' = Hidalgo.,Beyträge und Bemerkungen zu dem erſten Bande feines Systema Avium,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/86743#page/262/mode/1up,Picus Aurifrons
