11113,species,Falconiformes,Falconidae,Falcons and Caracaras,Caracara plancus,"(Miller, JF, 1777)","Icones Animalium: Various subjects of natural history, wherein are delineated birds, animals and many curious plants, with the parts of fructification of each plant, all of which are drawn and coloured from nature pt3 pl.17",Crested Caracara,Crested Caracara,Crested Caracara,515,"Taxon cheriway is considered conspecific with Caracara plancus based on clinal variation in morphology, the presence of a broad zone of introgression between the two (Dove & Banks 1999), and very low levels of divergence at nuclear and mitochondrial DNA loci (Fuchs et al. 2012a).",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22729784,y00678,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/y00678/,avibase-CFED276F,,,Tierra del Fuego.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/196473#page/47/mode/1up,Falco Plancus
