11118,genus,Falconiformes,Falconidae,Falcons and Caracaras,Daptrius,"Vieillot, LJP, 1816",Analyse d'une Nouvelle Ornithologie Élémentaire p.22,,,,516,"Genetic data indicate that Milvago is not monophyletic (Fuchs et al. 2012a, 2015), with taxon chimango identified as the sister lineage to Phalcoboenus. Pending description of a new genus, chimango could be placed in Phalcoboenus or retained in Milvago. Alternatively, as here, chimango, the four species of Phalcoboenus, and M. chimachima, are folded into a single genus, Daptrius, consistent with evidence for a recent radiation in this group (Fuchs et al. 2015).",,,,,,,,M,"Daptrius ater [Vieillot, 1816]; type by monotypy",,,https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k9745205x/f28.item,Daptrius
