11516,species,Psittaciformes,Psittacidae,African and New World Parrots,Pionus tumultuosus,"(Tschudi, JJ, 1844)",Archiv für Naturgeschichte 10 p.304,Speckle-faced Parrot,Speckle-faced Parrot,,626,"Taxon seniloides (monotypic) is treated as a subspecies of Pionus tumultuosus based on available evidence. Although seniloides differs in a number of plumage characters, and shows differentiation based on genomic (Smith et al. 2023) and mitochondrial DNA data (Ribas et al. 2007), a more thorough review of plumage variation, vocalizations, and genetics, including in areas of possible intergradation, is needed before implementing a split.",,,NE,,spfpar1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/spfpar1/,avibase-93DC24A5,,,Peru.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/48694#page/318/mode/1up,Psittacus tumultuosus
