11577,species,Psittaciformes,Psittacidae,African and New World Parrots,Amazona farinosa,"(Boddaert, P, 1783)",Table des planches enluminéez d'histoire naturelle de M. D'Aubenton p.52,Mealy Amazon,Mealy Amazon,,630,"Taxon guatemalae (polytypic) is treated as conspecific with Amazona farinosa based on apparent intergradation in plumage characters across a broad contact zone and absence of consistent differentiation in vocalizations (Hellmich et al. 2021). Although a relatively deep mitochondrial DNA divergence separates farinosa and guatemalae (Wenner et al. 2012; Hellmich et al. 2021), genomic differentiation (Smith et al. 2023) is less pronounced; further research to assess the extent of gene flow between these taxa would be informative.",,,NE,,meapar,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/meapar/,avibase-A05EF311,,,"Cayenne, ex Daubenton, pi. 861.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/88617#page/74/mode/1up,Psittacus farinosus
