11782,species,Psittaciformes,Psittacidae,African and New World Parrots,Psittacara holochlorus,"(Sclater, PL, 1859)","The Annals and Magazine of Natural History including Zoology, Botany, and Geology ser.3, vol.4, no.21 p.224",Green Parakeet,Green Parakeet,,637,"The monotypic taxa strenuus and brevipes are treated as species separate from Psittacara holochlorus (polytypic) pending further research. Available evidence regarding species limits in this complex are insufficient and conflicting, with no clear consensus among mitochondrial DNA datasets (Schweizer et al. 2014; Urantówka et al. 2014; Martínez-Gómez et al. 2017) or those from genomic DNA (Smith et al. 2023). Formal bioacoustic analyses and a comprehensive genetic review are needed before redefining species limits in this complex.",,,NE,,grnpar,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/grnpar/,avibase-67D6698A,,,"Jalapa, Vera Cruz.",XXIV. Descriptions of two new Species of American Parrots.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/19633#page/244/mode/1up,Conurus holochlorus
