11942,genus,Psittaciformes,Psittaculidae,Old World Parrots,Psittacula,"Cuvier, GLCFD, 1800",Leçons d'anatomie comparée 1 endtable,,,,652,"A broad genus Psittacula sensu lato (including Lophopsittacus) is advocated for the present. However, this renders the genus paraphyletic based on mitochondrial DNA (Braun et al. 2016, 2019) and genomic data (Smith et al. 2023), with Tanygnathus embedded within it. Although mitochondrial DNA also placed Psittinus within Psittacula sensu lato, this relationship was not recovered using genomic data. A thorough assessment of the revisions proposed by Braun et al. (2016, 2019) is needed.",,,,,,,,F,"Psittacus alexandri [Linnaeus, 1758]; type by subsequent designation (Mathews, 1917, Birds Australia, 6, p. 169).",,,,Psittacula
