12139,species,Psittaciformes,Psittaculidae,Old World Parrots,Loriculus bonapartei,"de Souancé, C, 1856","Revue et Magasin de Zoologie Pure et Appliquée (2), 8 p.222",Black-billed Hanging Parrot,Black-billed Hanging-Parrot,,669,"Taxa camiguinensis and bonapartei are treated as monotypic species separate from Loriculus philippensis (polytypic) based on available evidence. Phenotypically, these are the most distinctive taxa in the philippensis complex (Arndt 2006; Tello et al. 2006; Allen 2020), differing in size and lack of sexual dimorphism (camiguinensis), and bare parts color (bonapartei). A comprehensive genetic and morphological review of the entire philippensis complex is needed, in which additional splits may be warranted.","Sulu Archipelago (Bongao, Jolo, and Tawitawi)",,NE,,phihap11,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/phihap11/,avibase-476E91FD,,,Sulu Archipelago.,"Catalogue des perroquets de la collection du prince Masséna d'Essling, duc de Rivoli, et observations sur quelques espèces nouvelles ou peu connues de Psittacidés (Voir 1856, p. 56 et 152.).",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/19522#page/228/mode/1up,Loriculus Bonapartei
