12157,genus,Psittaciformes,Psittaculidae,Old World Parrots,Nannopsittacus,"Mathews, GM, 1916","The birds of Australia 6, 1916 p.65.",,,,N-72,"Suavipsitta Mathews, 1917 was an obsolete replacement name for a prior name, Nannopsittacus Mathews, 1916. Contra Mathews’ (1917) argument, Nannopsittacus is not a junior homonym of Nannopsittaca Ridgway, 1912 because of the Code’s one-letter rule (ICZN Article 57.6).",,,,,,,,M,Cyclopsitta suavissima [Sclater]; type by original designation,,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/224562#page/101/mode/1up,Nannopsittacus
12158,species,Psittaciformes,Psittaculidae,Old World Parrots,Nannopsittacus melanogenia,"(Rosenberg, KBH, 1866)",Nederlandsch Tijdschrift voor de Dierkunde 3 p.330,Dusky-cheeked Fig Parrot,Dusky-cheeked Fig-Parrot,Dusky-cheeked Fig-parrot,667,"Nannopsittacus gulielmitertii is split into three species based on differences in plumage and size following Schnitker (2007): N. gulielmitertii (monotypic); N. nigrifrons (polytypic, including amabilis); and N. melanogenius (polytypic, including fuscifrons and suavissimus); genetic data would be informative.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22725367,orbfip1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/orbfip1/,avibase-E6439BAF,,,Aru Islands.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/48369#page/672/mode/1up,Psittacula melanogenia
