12162,species,Psittaciformes,Psittaculidae,Old World Parrots,Nannopsittacus gulielmitertii,"(Schlegel, H, 1866)",Nederlandsch Tijdschrift voor de Dierkunde 3 p.252,Blue-fronted Fig Parrot,Blue-fronted Fig-Parrot,Blue-fronted Fig-parrot,667,"Nannopsittacus gulielmitertii is split into three species based on differences in plumage and size following Schnitker (2007): N. gulielmitertii (monotypic); N. nigrifrons (polytypic, including amabilis); and N. melanogenius (polytypic, including fuscifrons and suavissimus); genetic data would be informative.","western New Guinea (western Bird's Head Peninsula), including Salawati (Raja Ampat Islands, off western New Guinea)",,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22725355,orbfip2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/orbfip2/,avibase-1422A495,,,Salawati and New Guinea.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/193224#page/266/mode/1up,Psittacula gulielmi III
