12166,genus,Psittaciformes,Psittaculidae,Old World Parrots,Cyclopsitta,"Reichenbach, HGL, 1850",Avium Systema Naturale. Das natürliche System der Vögel mit hundert Tafeln grösstentheils Original-Abbildungen der bis jetzt entdecken fast zwölfhundert typischen Formen. Vorlaüfer einer Iconographie der Arten der Vögel aller Welttheile pl.LXXXII,,,,,,,,,,,,,F,"Psittacula diophthalma [Hombron & Jacquinot, 1841]; type by subsequent monotypy (Pucheran, 1853, in Hombron & Jacquinot, Voyage au Pôle Sud, Zool., 3, p. 107).",,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/183486#page/189/mode/1up,Cyclopsitta
12167,species,Psittaciformes,Psittaculidae,Old World Parrots,Cyclopsitta diophthalma,"(Hombron, JB; Jacquinot, H, 1841)","Annales des Sciences Naturelles Zoologie (2), 16 p.318",Double-eyed Fig Parrot,Double-eyed Fig-Parrot,,668,"Taxon coxeni is treated as a subspecies of Cyclopsitta diophthalma based on available evidence. Although morphologically the most distinctive taxon in the group, mitochondrial DNA data (Mitchell et al. 2021) show it to be embedded within C. diophthalma. A comprehensive genomic and phenotypic review is needed to determine species limits in this complex, in which one or more splits may be warranted.",,,NE,,defpar1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/defpar1/,avibase-0BB10D68,,,Southern coast of New Guinea = Triton Bay.,"Description de plusieurs Oiseaux nouveaux ou peu connus, provenant de l'expédition autour du monde faite sur les corvettes l'Astrolabe et la Zélée.",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/110495#page/326/mode/1up,Psittacula diophthalma
