12892,species,Passeriformes,Tityridae,"Tityras, Becards, and Allies",Pachyramphus viridis,"(Vieillot, LJP, 1816)","Nouveau dictionnaire d'histoire naturelle, appliquée aux arts, à l'agriculture, à l'économie rurale et domestique, à la médecine, etc. Nouvelle édition 3 p.348",Green-backed Becard,Green-backed Becard,,832,"Taxa xanthogenys (polytypic) and griseigularis are treated as conspecific with Pachyramphus viridis based on vocal similarity and genetics (Barber & Rice 2007; Musher & Cracraft 2018; Musher et al. 2019), supported by relatively minor plumage differences. Mitochondrial DNA data align griseigularis with xanthogenys (Musher & Cracraft 2018), rather than viridis as traditionally placed; further genomic and bioacoustic research on species limits would be informative.",,,NE,,grbbec1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/grbbec1/,avibase-6D956489,,,Paraguay.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/68874#page/370/mode/1up,Tityra viridis
