14678,species,Passeriformes,Thamnophilidae,"Antbirds, Antshrikes, Antwrens, and Antvireos",Sakesphorus canadensis,"(Linnaeus, C, 1766)",Systema Naturæ. Editio duodecima reformata. Tomus I [part 1] p.134,Black-crested Antshrike,,Black-crested Antshrike,820,"Taxon pulchellus is treated as a species separate from Sakesphorus canadensis based on differences in vocalizations (Boesman 2016ff), genomic DNA (Harvey et al. 2020), and plumage. Nevertheless, a formal bioacoustic analysis and broader genetic sampling would be informative. Subsequent to the vote to split pulchellus, this split was considered by and rejected by SACC, and hence is likely to be reconsidered for a future version of AviList.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/103657712,bkcant2,,avibase-7608AA0E,,,"Canada; error = Cayenne, by designation of Berlepsch and Hartert, Nov. Zool., 9, 1902, p. 70.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/137337#page/138/mode/1up,Lanius canadensis
