14700,species,Passeriformes,Thamnophilidae,"Antbirds, Antshrikes, Antwrens, and Antvireos",Thamnophilus ruficapillus,"Vieillot, LJP, 1816","Nouveau dictionnaire d'histoire naturelle, appliquée aux arts, à l'agriculture, à l'économie rurale et domestique, à la médecine, etc. Nouvelle édition 3 p.318",Rufous-capped Antshrike,Rufous-capped Antshrike,,823,"Taxon subfasciatus (polytypic) is treated as conspecific with Thamnophilus ruficapillus pending further research. Genomic data (Harvey et al. 2020) indicate that the T. ruficapillus complex is paraphyletic, but subspecies subfasciatus has not been sampled. Broader genetic sampling and formal bioacoustic analyses will be needed to better define species limits in this complex.",,,NE,,rucant1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/rucant1/,avibase-48FD5F69,,,"no locality; Corrientes suggested as type-locality by Hellmayr, 1924.",IX. Révision des espèces d'Oiseaux du genre Magalonyx.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/68874#page/338/mode/1up,Thamnophilus ruficapillus
