15205,species,Passeriformes,Grallariidae,Antpittas,Grallaria spatiator,"Bangs, O, 1898",Proceedings of the Biological Society of Washington 12 p.177,Sierra Nevada Antpitta,Sierra Nevada Antpitta,,744,"A revision of the Grallaria rufula complex is adopted based on the comprehensive reviews of Chesser et al. (2020a) and Isler et al. (2020) integrating genetic, vocal, and plumage characters. This includes recognition of Grallaria rufocinerea as a member of this complex; elevating taxa spatiator, saltuensis, saturata, occabambae (including a newly described subspecies, marcapatensis), cochabambae, cajamarcae, rufula, and obscura to species rank; and the recognition of six monotypic species that are newly described: G. alvarezi; G. gravesi; G. oneilli; G. centralis; G. ayacuchensis; and G. sinaensis.",Santa Marta Mountains (northeastern Colombia),,NE,,rufant5,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/rufant5/,avibase-7F337E40,,,"Macotama, 8000 feet, Sierra Nevada de Santa Marta, Colombia.","On some birds from the Sierra Nevada de Santa Marta, Colombia.",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/24139#page/203/mode/1up,Grallaria spatiator
