15207,species,Passeriformes,Grallariidae,Antpittas,Grallaria rufocinerea,"Sclater, PL; Salvin, O, 1879","Proceedings of the Zoological Society of London 1879, pt.3 p.526",Bicolored Antpitta,Bicolored Antpitta,Bicolored Antpitta,,,central Andes of Colombia (from Antioquia southward) to eastern Andes of far northern Ecuador (northwestern Sucumbíos),,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22703292,bicant3,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/bicant3/,avibase-E1A86347,,,"Santa Elena, Antioquia, Colombia.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/90455#page/288/mode/1up,Grallaria rufo-cinerea
