15671,species,Passeriformes,Furnariidae,Ovenbirds and Woodcreepers,Xiphorhynchus guttatus,"(Lichtenstein, MHC, 1820)",Abhandlungen der physikalischen Klasse der Königlich-Preussischen Akademie der Wissenschaften p.201,Buff-throated Woodcreeper,Buff-throated Woodcreeper,,728,"Taxon guttatoides (polytypic, including dorbignyanus) is treated as conspecific with Xiphorhynchus guttatus pending further research. Xiphorhynchus guttatus forms a complex with X. susurrans (polytypic) and the two groups have previously been treated as conspecific. Mitochondrial-dominated DNA data (Aleixo 2002; Rocha et al. 2015) recovered X. susurrans as embedded within the X. guttatus complex, and identified deep divergences suggestive of species-level differences; however, populations of the guttatus group were separated geographically by the guttatoides group, creating a leapfrog distribution pattern. Given this complexity, we refrain from splitting guttatoides pending availability of genomic data and a comprehensive analysis of vocalizations that includes X. susurrans.",,,NE,,butwoo1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/butwoo1/,avibase-34528F8F,,,"no locality = Baia, ex op. cit., 1822, p. 264.",Der Gattung Dendrocolaptes.,http://bibliothek.bbaw.de/bbaw/bibliothek-digital/digitalequellen/schriften/anzeige/index_html?band=07-abh/18181819&seite:int=246,Dendrocolaptes guttatus
