17524,species,Passeriformes,Campephagidae,Cuckooshrikes,Pericrocotus solaris,"Blyth, E, 1846","Journal of the Asiatic Society of Bengal 15, no.172 p.310",Grey-chinned Minivet,Gray-chinned Minivet,,1090,"Taxon montanus (polytypic, including cinereigula) is treated as conspecific with Pericrocotus solaris pending further research. Although sometimes treated as a separate species based on plumage, vocal, and genetic differences, compelling demonstrations of vocal differentiation remain lacking, mtDNA divergence (Jønsson et al. 2010a) is borderline, and plumage differences are limited. Future analyses based on a more comprehensive and deeper sampling across these data types may provide support for this split.",,,NE,,gycmin1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/gycmin1/,avibase-A3538EDB,,,"Darjeeling, Bengal.","Notices and Descriptions of various New or Little Known Species of Birds. [Continued from p. 54, ante.].",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/123983#page/438/mode/1up,P[ericrocotus] Solaris
