17781,species,Passeriformes,Campephagidae,Cuckooshrikes,Celebesica abbotti,"Riley, JH, 1918",Proceedings of the Biological Society of Washington 31 p.158,Pygmy Cuckooshrike,Pygmy Cuckooshrike,Pygmy Cuckooshrike,1091,"Generic assignments in Campephagidae have been adjusted according to information from multilocus DNA data (McCullough et al. 2022) indicating the existence of a deeply-diverged monospecific genus for Celebesica abbotti, the embedment of parvula within Coracina, and the placement of anale, caerulescens, and ostentum (sometimes separated in the genus Analisoma) in a basal position within the genus Edolisoma.","high montane forest of northern, central, and southeastern Sulawesi",,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22706532,pygcus1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/pygcus1/,avibase-84B08BC5,,,"Rano-Rano, Celebes.",Two new genera and eight new birds from Celebes.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/22865#page/198/mode/1up,Celebesia abbotti
