ecies are unchanged. Further research is needed, including genomic, bioacoustic, and morphological analyses, to affirm some of these novel taxonomic treatments and to check for additional species-level diversity in the complex.",,,NE,,,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/sulcus2/,avibase-E7E09EF8,,,"near Gorontalo and Tondano, north Celebes.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/258134#page/205/mode/1up,Ceblepyris morio
