 genomic, bioacoustic, and morphological analyses, to affirm some of these novel taxonomic treatments and to check for additional species-level diversity in the complex.","Rossel (Louisiade Archipelago, off southeastern New Guinea)",,NT,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/103702615,comcic5,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/comcic5/,avibase-D3CA1D45,,,Rossel Island.,[Description of three new species of birds from the Louisiade Archipelago].,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/101092#page/540/mode/1up,Edoliosoma rostratum
