18877,subspecies,Passeriformes,Pachycephalidae,Whistlers and Allies,Pachycephala orpheus par,"Hartert, EJO, 1904","Novitates Zoologicae 11, no.1 p.211",,,,1066,"Taxa par and compar are treated as subspecies of Pachycephala orpheus based on the mitochondrial DNA data of Jønsson et al. (2014), supported by male plumage and biogeographic considerations. Sometimes treated as a separate species (P. par, including ssp. compar), or as subspecies of P. macrorhyncha, but readily distinguished from the latter by the hen-plumaged males, a trait that aligns them with P. orpheus.",Romang (eastern Lesser Sundas),,,,yetwhi13,,avibase-78C89FEF,,,Roma Island.,"The Birds of the South-West Islands Wetter, Roma, Kisser, Letti and Moa.",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/24181#page/225/mode/1up,Pachycephala par
