19064,species,Passeriformes,Rhipiduridae,Fantails and Silktails,Rhipidura cockerelli,"(Ramsay, EP, 1879)",Nature 20 p.125,White-winged Fantail,White-winged Fantail,White-winged Fantail,852,"Taxon coultasi is treated as a monotypic species separate from Rhipidura cockerelli based on differences in plumage, supported by limited vocal material. Mitochondrial DNA data (Smith & Filardi 2007) suggest that albina may also warrant species status, although coultasi was not included in the analysis. A comprehensive morphological, vocal, and genetic review of this complex is needed.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/103709333,whwfan1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/whwfan1/,avibase-F1A01F97,,,"Lango, Guadalcanal.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/61875#page/147/mode/1up,Sauloprocta cockerelli
