19144,species,Passeriformes,Rhipiduridae,Fantails and Silktails,Rhipidura habibiei,"Rheindt, FE; Prawiradilaga, DM; Ashari, H; Suparno; Ng, NSR, 2020","Science 367 167-170, Suppl. p. 8-14 [p. 8]",Peleng Fantail,Peleng Fantail,,856,"The new taxon Rhipidura habibiei is recognized as a species, separate to R. teysmanni and R. sulaensis, based on a combination of bioacoustic and genome-wide DNA data (Ng et al. 2017; Rheindt et al. 2020), supplemented by minor plumage differences.","Peleng, in Banggai Islands (off eastern Sulawesi)",,NE,,pelfan1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/pelfan1/,avibase-F36F6683,,,,A lost world in Wallacea: Description of a montane archipelagic avifauna,https://science.sciencemag.org/content/367/6474/167,Rhipidura habibiei
