19341,species,Passeriformes,Dicruridae,Drongos,Dicrurus modestus,"Hartlaub, KJG, 1849","Revue et Magasin de Zoologie Pure et Appliquée (2), 1 p.495",Velvet-mantled Drongo,Velvet-mantled Drongo,Velvet-mantled Drongo,700,"Although sometimes treated as a monotypic species, taxon atactus is treated as a subspecies of Dicrurus modestus (polytypic) based on evidence of intergradation between subspecies atactus and coracinus. Genetic evidence is contradictory; although mitochondrial DNA data suggest non-monophyly of D. modestus sensu lato (Fuchs et al. 2017b, 2018a), this is not supported by nuclear DNA data (Fuchs et al. 2018a); further research investigating levels of gene flow would be informative.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/103710940,vemdro6,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/vemdro6/,avibase-5DEB4565,,,Principe Island.,Description de cinq nouvelles espèces d'Oiseaux de l'Afrique occidentale.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/19604#page/531/mode/1up,Dicrurus modestus
