19600,species,Passeriformes,Monarchidae,"Monarch Flycatchers, Paradise Flycatchers, and Shrikebills",Monarcha godeffroyi,"Hartlaub, KJG, 1868","Proceedings of the Zoological Society of London 1867, pt.3 p.829 pl.38",Yap Monarch,Yap Monarch,Yap Monarch,1059,"Taxon rugensis is placed in the monospecific genus Metabolus, while taxa takatsukasae and godeffroyi are placed in Monarcha. Mitochondrial-dominated DNA data (Andersen et al. 2015b) recovered these species, along with Pomarea nigra and P. dimidiata, as an unresolved polytomy at the base of the main Monarcha assemblage. Given the nomenclatural issues that arise due to paraphyly of Pomarea, and lack of statistical support for alternative generic arrangements among these 5 species, the IOC 13.2 classification has been adopted pending a comprehensive genomic review of the complex.",forest of Yap (northwestern Caroline Islands),,NT,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22707333,yapmon1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/yapmon1/,avibase-5280B180,,,Yap.,On a Collection of Birds from some less-known Localities in the Western Pacific.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/90421#page/249/mode/1up,Monarcha godeffroyi
19601,species,Passeriformes,Monarchidae,"Monarch Flycatchers, Paradise Flycatchers, and Shrikebills",Monarcha takatsukasae,"(Yamashina, Y, 1931)",Dobutsugaku Zasshi 43 p.485,Tinian Monarch,Tinian Monarch,Tinian Monarch,1059,"Taxon rugensis is placed in the monospecific genus Metabolus, while taxa takatsukasae and godeffroyi are placed in Monarcha. Mitochondrial-dominated DNA data (Andersen et al. 2015b) recovered these species, along with Pomarea nigra and P. dimidiata, as an unresolved polytomy at the base of the main Monarcha assemblage. Given the nomenclatural issues that arise due to paraphyly of Pomarea, and lack of statistical support for alternative generic arrangements among these 5 species, the IOC 13.2 classification has been adopted pending a comprehensive genomic review of the complex.",Mariana Islands (Tinian and Aguijan),,NT,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22707336,tinmon1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/tinmon1/,avibase-52228B7B,,,Tinian.,On new Birds from the Pelew and Marianne Islands.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/100946#page/144/mode/1up,Monarcharses takatsukasae
