19613,species,Passeriformes,Monarchidae,"Monarch Flycatchers, Paradise Flycatchers, and Shrikebills",Monarcha richardsii,"(Ramsay, EP, 1881)",Proceedings of the Linnean Society of New South Wales 6 p.177,White-capped Monarch,White-capped Monarch,White-capped Monarch,1054,"Two species are recognized in the Chestnut-bellied Monarch complex based on available evidence: polytypic Monarcha castaneiventris and monotypic M. richardsii. Species limits in this complex are poorly understood and there are incongruences between phenotypic and genetic datasets. Although M. richardsii has been treated as a species based on plumage, it is embedded within M. castaneiventris based on multilocus DNA data (Andersen et al. 2015b), a pattern that could result from mitochondrial DNA introgression. Further research will be needed to determine species limits in this complex.",forest of central Solomon Islands,,NT,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22707252,whcmon1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/whcmon1/,avibase-421C9B38,,,Ugi (by error) = Rendova.,Notes on the Zoology of the Solomon Islands. - Part II.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/22895#page/187/mode/1up,Piezorhynchus Richardsii
19614,species,Passeriformes,Monarchidae,"Monarch Flycatchers, Paradise Flycatchers, and Shrikebills",Monarcha castaneiventris,"Verreaux, JP, 1858","Revue et Magasin de Zoologie Pure et Appliquée (2), 10 p.304",Chestnut-bellied Monarch,Chestnut-bellied Monarch,,1054,"Two species are recognized in the Chestnut-bellied Monarch complex based on available evidence: polytypic Monarcha castaneiventris and monotypic M. richardsii. Species limits in this complex are poorly understood and there are incongruences between phenotypic and genetic datasets. Although M. richardsii has been treated as a species based on plumage, it is embedded within M. castaneiventris based on multilocus DNA data (Andersen et al. 2015b), a pattern that could result from mitochondrial DNA introgression. Further research will be needed to determine species limits in this complex.",,,NE,,,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/chbmon1/,avibase-13466813,,,Guadalcanal.,Description d'Oiseaux nouveaux.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/19550#page/307/mode/1up,Monarcha castaneiventris
