19731,genus,Passeriformes,Paradisaeidae,Birds-of-paradise,Lophorina,"Vieillot, LJP, 1816",Analyse d'une Nouvelle Ornithologie Élémentaire p.35,,,,877,"The riflebirds are placed in Ptiloris, rather than Lophorina, based on morphological evidence. However, mitochondrial DNA and multilocus data (Irestedt et al. 2009, 2017) indicate a deep divergence within Ptiloris which may render the genus paraphyletic; further research required.",,,,,,,,F,"Paradisea superba [Forster, JR, 1781]; type by monotypy = Paradisea superba J.R. Forster, 1781  ",,,https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k9745205x/f41.item,Lophorina
19732,species,Passeriformes,Paradisaeidae,Birds-of-paradise,Lophorina superba,"(Pennant, T, 1781)",Indische Zoologie oder systematischer Beschreibungen seltener und unbekannter Thiere aus Indien (etc.) p.40,Vogelkop Lophorina,Vogelkop Lophorina,Western Superb Bird-of-paradise,876,"Taxon latipennis of central New Guinea (polytypic, including feminina and addenda) is treated as a species separate from Lophorina superba of western New Guinea (polytypic, including niedda), and L. minor from southeastern New Guinea, based on the mitochondrial DNA data of Irestedt et al. (2017). This treatment is also based on arguments for re-neotypification of superba to the Vogelkop population and resolution of disagreement as to the nomenclature of the western and central taxa (Schodde et al. 2021; Elliott et al. 2022). The affinities of addenda will require clarification using nuclear or genomic DNA.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/181524349,,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/vosbop1/,avibase-54154974,,,New Guinea. (Based on Martinet's pl. 632 in Buffon's les Planches enluminées).,Specimen Faunulae Indicae,"https://gdz.sub.uni-goettingen.de/id/PPN600894029?tify={%22pages%22:[56],%22panX%22:0.643,%22panY%22:0.694,%22view%22:%22toc%22,%22zoom%22:1.909}",Paradisea Superba
19733,subspecies,Passeriformes,Paradisaeidae,Birds-of-paradise,Lophorina superba superba,"(Pennant, T, 1781)",Indische Zoologie oder systematischer Beschreibungen seltener und unbekannter Thiere aus Indien (etc.) p.40,,,,,,mountains of the Bird's Head Peninsula (northwestern New Guinea),,,,,,avibase-3D7987EB,,,New Guinea. (Based on Martinet's pl. 632 in Buffon's les Planches enluminées).,Specimen Faunulae Indicae,"https://gdz.sub.uni-goettingen.de/id/PPN600894029?tify={%22pages%22:[56],%22panX%22:0.643,%22panY%22:0.694,%22view%22:%22toc%22,%22zoom%22:1.909}",Paradisea Superba
19734,subspecies,Passeriformes,Paradisaeidae,Birds-of-paradise,Lophorina superba niedda,"Mayr, E, 1930",Ornithologische Monatsberichte 38 p.179,,,,,,"mountains of the Wandammen Peninsula (Bird's Neck, West Papua, New Guinea)",,,,vosbop1,,avibase-507F94D7,,,"Wondiwoi, Wandammen Mountains.",Die Unterarten des Kragenparadiesvogels (Lophorina superba).,https://www.zobodat.at/pdf/Ornithologische-Monatberichte_38_0178-0180.pdf#page=2,Lophorina superba niedda
19735,species,Passeriformes,Paradisaeidae,Birds-of-paradise,Lophorina latipennis,"Rothschild, LW, 1907",Bulletin of the British Ornithologists' Club 19 p.92,Greater Lophorina,Greater Lophorina,Central Superb Bird-of-paradise,876,"Taxon latipennis of central New Guinea (polytypic, including feminina and addenda) is treated as a species separate from Lophorina superba of western New Guinea (polytypic, including niedda), and L. minor from southeastern New Guinea, based on the mitochondrial DNA data of Irestedt et al. (2017). This treatment is also based on arguments for re-neotypification of superba to the Vogelkop population and resolution of disagreement as to the nomenclature of the western and central taxa (Schodde et al. 2021; Elliott et al. 2022). The affinities of addenda will require clarification using nuclear or genomic DNA.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/181524111,,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/grsbop1/,avibase-0B08DF8F,,,Rawlinson Mountains.,Description of a new Bird-of-Paradise.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/100946#page/516/mode/1up,Lophorina minor latipennis
19736,subspecies,Passeriformes,Paradisaeidae,Birds-of-paradise,Lophorina latipennis feminina,"Ogilvie-Grant, WR, 1915","Ibis ser.10, Jubilee suppl. no.2 p.27-28",,,,,,"montane western New Guinea, from the Kobowre mountains (West Papua, Indonesia) to the Sepik-Strickland River Divide (western Papua New Guinea)",,,,,,avibase-E07EE180,,,"Utakwa River, Nassau Range.",Report on the Birds collected by the British Ornithologists' Union Expedition and the Wollaston Expedition in Dutch New Guinea.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/100945#page/55/mode/1up,Lophorina superba feminina
