19868,species,Passeriformes,Laniidae,Shrikes,Lanius collaris,"Linnaeus, C, 1766",Systema Naturæ. Editio duodecima reformata. Tomus I [part 1] p.135,Southern Fiscal,Southern Fiscal,,313,"Taxon humeralis (polytypic, including smithii and capelli) is split from Lanius collaris (polytypic) based on genetics. Mitochondrial DNA data (Fuchs et al. 2011, 2019) identified a deep divergence between the northern humeralis group and the southern collaris group. Furthermore, L. collaris sensu lato was not recovered as monophyletic, with L. souzae embedded within the complex. A more comprehensive review incorporating vocal, morphological, and genomic data is needed.",,,NE,,soufis1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/soufis1/,avibase-FFA65A47,,,Cape of Good Hope.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/137337#page/139/mode/1up,Lanius collaris
