20113,species,Passeriformes,Corvidae,"Crows, Jays, and Magpies",Cyanocorax yncas,"(Boddaert, P, 1783)",Table des planches enluminéez d'histoire naturelle de M. D'Aubenton p.38,Green Jay,Green Jay,Green Jay,1098,"Taxon luxuosus is treated as a subspecies of Cyanocorax yncas pending further research. Although mitochondrial-dominated DNA data (Bonaccorso et al. 2010) indicate the presence of two clades, geographic sampling is limited, ventral plumage coloration is highly variable, and vocalizations have not been formally analysed. A comprehensive, integrative analysis of genetics, plumage, and vocalizations across all populations is needed to determine species limits in this group.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22705738,grnjay,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/grnjay/,avibase-361B447A,,,"Peru; type locality restricted by Zimmer (1953, Amer. Mus. Novit., no. 25, p. 7) to Chilpes, Dept. Junin.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/88617#page/60/mode/1up,Corvus yncas
