20282,subspecies,Passeriformes,Corvidae,"Crows, Jays, and Magpies",Corvus corone cornix,"Linnaeus, C, 1758","Systema Naturæ per Regna Tria Naturæ, Secundum Classes, Ordines, Genera, Species, cum Characteribus, Differentiis, Synonymis, Locis. Tomus I. Editio decima, reformata 1 p.105",,,,,,"northern Europe to Yenisey Valley, Ukraine, Corsica, and southern Italy",,,,hoocro4,,avibase-81B32602,,,"'Europa;' restricted to Sweden by Hartert (1903, Vog. pal. Fauna, 1, p. 9).",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/10277#page/123/mode/1up,Corvus Cornix
