20309,species,Passeriformes,Corvidae,"Crows, Jays, and Magpies",Corvus enca,"(Horsfield, T, 1821)","Transactions of the Linnean Society of London 13, pt.1 p.164",Sunda Crow,Sunda Crow,,1077,"The Slender-billed Crow Corvus enca complex is divided into 5 species based on a combination of bioacoustic, morphological, and mitochondrial DNA data (Jønsson et al. 2012; Eaton et al. 2021): Sulawesi Crow (C. celebensis, polytypic, including mangoli); Sunda Crow (C. enca, polytypic including compilator); Palawan Crow (C. pusillus, monotypic); Samar Crow (C. samarensis, monotypic); Sierra Madre Crow (C. sierramadrensis, monotypic). Further research is needed to corroborate the division of C. samarensis and C. sierramadrensis, and to assess the depth of divergence of the two subspecies within C. enca sensu stricto.",,,NE,,slbcro2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/slbcro2/,avibase-67E4D5DD,,,Java.,Systematic Arrangement and Description of Birds from the Island of Java.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/13692#page/183/mode/1up,Fregilus Enca
