20521,genus,Passeriformes,Petroicidae,Australasian Robins,Leucophantes,"Sclater, PL, 1874","Proceedings of the Zoological Society of London 1873, pt.3 p.691,textfig.",,,,1094,"Taxon brachyurus is placed in the monotypic genus Leucophantes based on an analysis of mitochondrial DNA data. Sometimes placed in Heteromyias (Beehler & Pratt 2016) based on shared morphological features, or Poecilodryas, mitochondrial DNA data recovered it as a deeply diverged lineage that is sister to Poecilodryas sensu stricto.",,,,,,,,M,Leucophantes brachyurus [P. L. Sclater]; type by monotypy,,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/90422#page/833/mode/1up,Leucophantes
