21033,species,Passeriformes,Alaudidae,Larks,Certhilauda curvirostris,"(Hermann, J, 1783)",Tabula affinitatum animalium (etc.) p.216,Cape Long-billed Lark,Cape Long-billed Lark,Cape Long-billed Lark,213,"Taxon brevirostris (monotypic) is treated as a subspecies of Certhilauda curvirostris (polytypic) based on clinal variation in morphology, similar vocalizations, and low genetic divergence. Mitochondrial DNA data (Alström et al. 2013; Stervander et al. 2020) also suggest that C. semitorquata is part of this complex; further research needed.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22735878,y00415,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/y00415/,avibase-C1C3C165,,,"Cape of Good Hope, ex Buff on, 5, p. 65.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/120418#page/236/mode/1up,Alauda curvirostris
