21235,species,Passeriformes,Alaudidae,Larks,Corypha somalica,"(Witherby, HF, 1903)",Bulletin of the British Ornithologists' Club 14 p.29,Somali Lark,Somali Lark,Somali Lark,1164,"Although sometimes split as a monotyic species, taxon ashi (with rochei as a junior synonym) is treated as a subspecies of Corypha somalica based on genomic DNA data, supported by phenotypic analysis (Alström et al. 2024).",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/200384015,,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/slblar1/,avibase-74DEDA0A,,,"Dibbit, Somaliland [Col. PI., Ibis, 1905, pi. 10, p. 512].",New birds from Somali-land.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/114181#page/511/mode/1up,Certhilauda somalica
