21927,species,Passeriformes,Cisticolidae,Cisticolas and Allies,Prinia bairdii,"(Cassin, J, 1855)",Proceedings of the Academy of Natural Sciences of Philadelphia 7 p.327,Banded Prinia,Banded Prinia,Banded Prinia,485,Taxon melanops (polytypic) is retained as a subspecies of Prinia bairdii based on similarities in plumage and vocalizations. Montane melanops is similar in appearance to lowland obscura and the latter hybridizes with bairdii in a narrow contact zone (Prigogine 1979). In the absence of genetic information all three are best considered conspecific.,,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22713647,banpri1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/banpri1/,avibase-C54D2FEE,,,"Moonda (= Mondah) River, Western Africa = Gabon.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/17735#page/350/mode/1up,Drymoica Bairdii
