22681,species,Passeriformes,Hirundinidae,Swallows,Stelgidopteryx serripennis,"(Audubon, JJ, 1838)",Ornithological Biography (etc.) 4 p.593,Northern Rough-winged Swallow,Northern Rough-winged Swallow,,1040,"Taxon ridgwayi (polytypic, including stuarti) is treated as conspecific with Stelgidopteryx serripennis based on available evidence. Divergence in plumage, mitochondrial DNA (Babin 2005) and genomic data (Brown 2019) is modest, apparent vocal differences (Boesman 2016g) have not been quantitatively analyzed, and evidence for sympatry is equivocal. Further research will be needed to determine if species status is warranted.",,,NE,,nrwswa,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/nrwswa/,avibase-2C1981BB,,,"Charleston, South Carolina.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/103783#page/625/mode/1up,Hirundo serripennis
