23237,species,Passeriformes,Phylloscopidae,Leaf Warblers,Phylloscopus trivirgatus,"Strickland, HE, 1849",Contributions to ornithology 2 p.123 pl.34 fig.2,Mountain Leaf Warbler,Mountain Leaf Warbler,,317,Taxon nigrorum (polytypic) is split from Phylloscopus trivirgatus (polytypic) based on plumage and genetics. Mitochondrial-dominated data consistently identify the Philippine group (nigrorum) as distinct from the trivirgatus group (Olsson et al. 2005; Jones & Kennedy 2008; Shakya et al. 2018); deep divergences among clades within nigrorum (Campbell et al. 2016) indicate that a more comprehensive review of this complex is warranted.,,,NE,,mouwar2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/mouwar2/,avibase-729B0E98,,,Java.,Illustrations of Ornithology.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/211381#page/266/mode/1up,Phylloscopus trivirgatus
