23245,species,Passeriformes,Phylloscopidae,Leaf Warblers,Phylloscopus nigrorum,"(Moseley, EL, 1891)","Ibis ser.6, vol.3, no.9 p.47, pl. II, fig. 1",Negros Leaf Warbler,Negros Leaf Warbler,,317,Taxon nigrorum (polytypic) is split from Phylloscopus trivirgatus (polytypic) based on plumage and genetics. Mitochondrial-dominated data consistently identify the Philippine group (nigrorum) as distinct from the trivirgatus group (Olsson et al. 2005; Jones & Kennedy 2008; Shakya et al. 2018); deep divergences among clades within nigrorum (Campbell et al. 2016) indicate that a more comprehensive review of this complex is warranted.,,,NE,,mouwar4,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/mouwar4/,avibase-AE9B0CE7,,,"Lake Danao, southern Negros, Philippines.","Descriptions of two new Species of Flycatchers from the Island of Negros, Philippines.",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/55012#page/79/mode/1up,Cryptolopha nigrorum
