23328,genus,Passeriformes,Pycnonotidae,Bulbuls,Atimastillas,"Oberholser, HC, 1905",Smithsonian Miscellaneous Collections 48 Quar.Iss. no.2 p.155,,,,,,,,,,,,,F,"Haematornis flavicollis [Swainson, 1837]; type by original designation",,The avian genus Bleda Bonaparte and some of its allies,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/94934#page/251/mode/1up,Atimastillas
23329,species,Passeriformes,Pycnonotidae,Bulbuls,Atimastillas flavicollis,"(Swainson, WJ, 1837)",The natural history of the birds of Western Africa 1 p.259,Yellow-gorgeted Greenbul,Yellow-gorgeted Greenbul,Yellow-throated Greenbul,1011,"Taxon flavigula (polytypic, including soror) is treated as a species separate from Atimastillas flavicollis based on plumage and vocalizations. Although plumages are geographically variable they show an abrupt transition, with an apparent lack of intergradation, where their ranges approach. Available genetic data are fragmentary (Moyle & Marks 2006; Johansson et al. 2007; Fregin et al. 2012a) and comparative data lacking; further research needed.",Senegal to eastern Nigeria and northern Cameroon,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/103817373,yetgre2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/yetgre2/,avibase-3C8E84A6,,,West Africa,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/57924#page/319/mode/1up,Haematornis flavicollis
