23388,species,Passeriformes,Pycnonotidae,Bulbuls,Phyllastrephus flavostriatus,"(Sharpe, RB, 1876)","Ibis ser.3, vol.6, no.21 p.53",Yellow-streaked Greenbul,Yellow-streaked Greenbul,Yellow-streaked Greenbul,1017,"Taxon alfredi is treated as a subspecies of Phyllastrephus flavostriatus based on available evidence. Although mitochondrial and nuclear DNA data (Lokugalappatti 2011) showed divergence of the phenotypically distinctive alfredi, elevation to species may create a paraphyletic P. flavostriatus; further research needed.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22730603,yesbul1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/yesbul1/,avibase-651384DF,,,"Macamac, Transvaal.",Descriptions of two new Species of South-African Birds.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/269437#page/75/mode/1up,Andropadus flavostriatus
