23416,species,Passeriformes,Pycnonotidae,Bulbuls,Phyllastrephus scandens,"Swainson, WJ, 1837",The natural history of the birds of Western Africa 1 p.270 pl.30,Leaf-love,Leaf-love,Leaf-love,1014,"Taxon scandens is placed in the genus Phyllastrephus based on genetic data (Moyle & Marks 2006; Johansson et al. 2007; Shakya & Sheldon 2017; De Santis et al. 2018). Although sometimes separated in the monospecific genus Pyrrhurus based mostly on the color pattern of its plumage, mitochondrial-dominated DNA data show scandens to be embedded within the Phyllastrephus group of species.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22712882,leaflo1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/leaflo1/,avibase-E781F61C,,,West Africa.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/57924#page/330/mode/1up,Phyllastrephus scandens
