23424,genus,Passeriformes,Pycnonotidae,Bulbuls,Microtarsus,"Eyton, TC, 1839","Proceedings of the Zoological Society of London pt.7, no.78 p.102",,,,761a,"The genus Microtarsus is recognized for seven taxa previously included under an expanded Pycnonotus. Five taxa (eutilotus, melanoleucos, urostictus, priocephalus, and melanocephalos) are included in Microtarsus based on the genetic analysis of Shakya & Sheldon (2017) with fuscoflavescens and nieuwenhuisii also placed here based on morphology.",,,,,,,,M,"Microtarsus melanoleucos [Eyton, 1839]; type by monotypy",,"Catalogue of a Collection of Birds from Malaya, with Descriptions of the New Species.",https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/96163#page/632/mode/1up,Microtarsus
