23657,species,Passeriformes,Pycnonotidae,Bulbuls,Ixos leucogrammicus,"Müller, S, 1836","Tijdschrift voor Natuurlijke Geschiedenis en Physiologie 2, pt.3 p.352",Cream-striped Bulbul,Cream-striped Bulbul,Cream-striped Bulbul,761d,"Taxon leucogrammicus is provisionally placed in the genus Ixos pending further research. Although available genetic evidence does not provide strong support for its exact placement (Shakya & Sheldon 2017), leucogrammicus was originally placed in Ixos based on morphology and is the treatment followed here. Taxon tympanistrigus is here assigned to Pycnonotus based on phenotypic evidence but further research is needed to determine its exact placement.",highland forest of western Sumatra,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/22712610,crsbul1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/crsbul1/,avibase-710EBAE8,,,Sumatra.,,https://books.google.ca/books?id=XERnAAAAcAAJ&pg=PA352#v=onepage&f=false,Ixos leucogrammicus
