24831,species,Passeriformes,Leiothrichidae,Laughingthrushes and Allies,Alcippe hueti,"David, A, 1874","Annales des Sciences Naturelles Zoologie (5), Tome XIX, Article no.9 p.4",Huet's Fulvetta,Huet's Fulvetta,,341,"The Alcippe morrisonia complex is treated as four species based on genetics: A. morrisonia (monotypic); A. hueti (polytypic, including rufescentior); A. fratercula (polytypic, including yunnanensis and laotiana); and A. davidi (polytypic, including schaefferi). Relatively deep mitochondrial DNA divergences separate these clades (Zou et al. 2007, 2008; Song et al. 2009), while nominate A. peracensis may be nested within this complex (Cai et al. 2019). More studies, including genomic and vocal data, are needed.",,,NE,,gycful5,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/gycful5/,avibase-EE1BC181,,,Fukien.,Description de quelques Oiseaux de Chine.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/103321#page/307/mode/1up,Alcippe Hueti
