27056,subspecies,Passeriformes,Turdidae,Thrushes and Allies,Turdus flavipes flavipes,"Vieillot, LJP, 1818","Nouveau dictionnaire d'histoire naturelle, appliquée aux arts, à l'agriculture, à l'économie rurale et domestique, à la médecine, etc. Nouvelle édition 20 p.277",,,,,,southeastern Brazil (southern Bahia) to northeastern Paraguay and northeastern Argentina,,,,yelthr6,,avibase-6A166CA1,,,"Brazil [= Rio de Janeiro; vide Hellmayr, 1934, ibid., p. 425] .",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/60115#page/295/mode/1up,Turdus flavipes
