28076,subspecies,Passeriformes,Muscicapidae,"Chats, Old World Flycatchers, and Allies",Oenanthe deserti deserti,"(Temminck, CJ, 1825)","Nouveau recueil de planches coloriées d'oiseaux, pour servir de suite et de complément aux planches enluminées de Buffon livr.60, vol.3 pl.359 fig.2",,,,,,"resident in northeastern Egypt (Sinai) and the Levant; breeding from southern Türkiye eastward, discontinuously, to Afghanistan, central and southern Kazakhstan, Mongolia, and northwestern and western China (northwestern Xinjiang, Gansu, Shaanxi, and central Inner Mongolia); wintering in northeastern Africa (including Socotra) and southwestern Asia",,,,deswhe3,,avibase-A81D73BA,,,Egypt.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/112979#page/433/mode/1up,Saxicola deserti
