28086,subspecies,Passeriformes,Muscicapidae,"Chats, Old World Flycatchers, and Allies",Oenanthe oenanthe libanotica,"(Hemprich, WF; Ehrenberg, CG, 1833)",Symbolae physicae seu icones et descriptiones corporum naturalium novorum aut minus cognitorum quae ex itineribus per Libyam Aegyptum Nubiam Dongolam Syrian Arabiam et Habessianiam publico institutis (etc.) sig.bb p.54,,,,,,"southern Spain and Balearic Islands to Iran, Kazakhstan, and Mongolia",,,,norwhe5,,avibase-161611C7,,,"all Syria [= Lebanon, fide Mackworth-Praed and Grant, 1951, Ibis, 93, p. 235].",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/189249#page/64/mode/1up,Saxicola libanotica
