28323,species,Passeriformes,Dicaeidae,Flowerpeckers,Dicaeum sanguinolentum,"Temminck, CJ, 1829","Nouveau recueil de planches coloriées d'oiseaux, pour servir de suite et de complément aux planches enluminées de Buffon livr.80, vol.4 pl.478 fig.2",Javan Flowerpecker,Javan Flowerpecker,Javan Flowerpecker,849,"The Dicaeum sanguinolentum complex is split into 4 monotypic species: D. sanguinolentum; D. rhodopygiale; D. wilhelminae; and D. hanieli, based on plumage and vocal differences (Rheindt & Eaton (2019). Formal bioacoustic analyses and genetic data would be informative.",montane Java and Bali,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/216915934,blbflo5,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/blbflo5/,avibase-F601E930,,,"Java; restricted to West Java by Robinson and Kloss, 1923, Journ. Fed. Malay States Mus., 11, p. 57.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/109923#page/234/mode/1up,Dicaeum sanguinolentum
28324,species,Passeriformes,Dicaeidae,Flowerpeckers,Dicaeum rhodopygiale,"Rensch, B, 1928",Ornithologische Monatsberichte 36 no.3 p.80,Flores Flowerpecker,Flores Flowerpecker,Flores Flowerpecker,849,"The Dicaeum sanguinolentum complex is split into 4 monotypic species: D. sanguinolentum; D. rhodopygiale; D. wilhelminae; and D. hanieli, based on plumage and vocal differences (Rheindt & Eaton (2019). Formal bioacoustic analyses and genetic data would be informative.",montane Flores (western Lesser Sundas),,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/216915953,blbflo6,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/blbflo6/,avibase-3C3C5EE8,,,"Rana Mese, 1,200 m., western Flores.",,https://www.zobodat.at/pdf/Ornithologische-Monatberichte_36_0080-0081.pdf,Dicaeum sanguinolentum rhodopygiale
28325,species,Passeriformes,Dicaeidae,Flowerpeckers,Dicaeum wilhelminae,"Büttikofer, J, 1892",Notes from the Leyden Museum 14 no.3&amp;4 p.199,Sumba Flowerpecker,Sumba Flowerpecker,Sumba Flowerpecker,849,"The Dicaeum sanguinolentum complex is split into 4 monotypic species: D. sanguinolentum; D. rhodopygiale; D. wilhelminae; and D. hanieli, based on plumage and vocal differences (Rheindt & Eaton (2019). Formal bioacoustic analyses and genetic data would be informative.",widespread on Sumba (western Lesser Sundas),,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/103776669,blbflo3,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/blbflo3/,avibase-0EC4EDBB,,,"Sumba, Lesser Sunda Islands.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/37348#page/209/mode/1up,Dicaeum wilhelminae
28326,species,Passeriformes,Dicaeidae,Flowerpeckers,Dicaeum hanieli,"Hellmayr, CE, 1912",Novitates Zoologicae 19 no.2 p.210,Timor Flowerpecker,Timor Flowerpecker,Timor Flowerpecker,849,"The Dicaeum sanguinolentum complex is split into 4 monotypic species: D. sanguinolentum; D. rhodopygiale; D. wilhelminae; and D. hanieli, based on plumage and vocal differences (Rheindt & Eaton (2019). Formal bioacoustic analyses and genetic data would be informative.",montane Timor (eastern Lesser Sundas),,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/103776714,blbflo4,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/blbflo4/,avibase-F5D63C6F,,,Timor.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/22249#page/230/mode/1up,Dicaeum hanieli
28327,species,Passeriformes,Dicaeidae,Flowerpeckers,Dicaeum keiense,"Salvadori, AT, 1874",Annali del Museo Civico di Storia Naturale di Genova 6 p.313,Pink-breasted Flowerpecker,Pink-breasted Flowerpecker,Pink-breasted Flowerpecker,850,"Taxon keiense (polytypic, including fulgidum) is treated as a species separate from Dicaeum hirundinaceum based on plumage differences, supported by vocalizations and biogeographic considerations. Taxon ignicolle, sometimes split as a separate species, is treated as a subspecies of D. hirundinaceum based mostly on plumage pattern, supported by biogeographic considerations. However, further research, including genetic and vocal evidence, is needed to determine whether ignicolle warrants species status or is better placed as a subspecies of D. keiense.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/103778206,mistle2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/pibflo1/,avibase-2A0A1DE3,,,Kei Islands.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/40858#page/331/mode/1up,Dicaeum keiense
