29145,species,Passeriformes,Ploceidae,Weavers and Allies,Euplectes laticauda,"(Lichtenstein, MHC, 1823)","Verzeichniss der Doubletten des zoologischen Museums der Königl. Universität zu Berlin nebst Beschreibung vieler bisher unbekannter Arten von Säugethieren, Vögeln, Amphibien und Fischen p.24",Red-cowled Widowbird,Red-cowled Widowbird,Red-cowled Widowbird,499,"Taxon laticauda (polytypic, including suahelicus) is split from Euplectes ardens (monotypic) based on differences in plumage, molts, and tail length. A genetic analysis dominated by mitochondrial DNA data places E. l. suahelicus as a divergent sister lineage to E. ardens (Prager et al. 2008) in support of this treatment; as nominate E. laticauda was not included in the analysis, further genetic work is desirable.",,,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/103810956,recwid2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/recwid2/,avibase-6A1F6033,,,Nubia.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/89675#page/44/mode/1up,Fringilla laticauda
