30076,genus,Passeriformes,Fringillidae,"Finches, Euphonias, and Allies",Chlorophonia,"Bonaparte, CLJL, 1851",Revue et Magasin de Zoologie Pure et Appliquée (2) 3 p.137,,,,1141,"Taxa elegantissima, musica, flavifrons, sclateri, and cyanocephala are placed in Chlorophonia rather than Euphonia based on genetic evidence. Nuclear, multilocus, and genomic DNA data (Zuccon et al. 2012; Imfeld et al. 2020; Vázquez-López et al. 2024) all recovered Euphonia as paraphyletic with respect to Chlorophonia. We recognize an expanded Chlorophonia rather than separating these five species in Cyanophonia as proposed by Imfeld et al. (2020).",,,,,,,,F,"Tanagra viridis [Vieillot, 1819]; type by subsequent designation (Gray, GR, 1855, Cat. of the Genera and Subgenera of Birds, p. 74). = Pipra cyanea Thunberg, 1822",,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/19559#page/147/mode/1up,Chlorophonia
