33371,species,Passeriformes,Thraupidae,Tanagers and Allies,Dubusia taeniata,"(Boissonneau, A, 1840)","Revue Zoologique, par la Société Cuvierienne 3 p.57",Buff-banded Mountain Tanager,,Buff-breasted Mountain-tanager,608,"The monotypic taxa carrikeri and stictocephala are treated as species separate from Dubusia taeniata based on plumage and vocalizations. Although vocal differences have been identified (Boesman 2016v), no formal analyses have been undertaken and vocalizations of taeniata are quite variable, suggesting further research is warranted. Genetic data would also be informative.","Andes of Venezuela, Colombia, Ecuador, and far northern Peru",,LC,https://datazone.birdlife.org/species/factsheet/103843076,bubmot3,,avibase-E9BC5A13,,,"Santa-Fe-de-Bogota, Colombia.",Oiseaux nouveaux de Santa-Fé de Bogota.,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/48713#page/77/mode/1up,Tanagra (Tachyphonus) taeniata
