33571,species,Passeriformes,Thraupidae,Tanagers and Allies,Tangara arthus,"Lesson, RP, 1832","Illustrations de zoologie, ou recueil de figures d'animaux peintes d'après nature livr.3 textpl.9",Golden Tanager,Golden Tanager,,602,"Taxon aurulenta (polytypic) is treated as conspecific with Tangara arthus pending further research. Plumage variation within this complex is extensive and it may comprise multiple species. An integrative analysis of plumage, vocalizations, and genetics is needed to better define species limits in this group.",,,NE,,goltan1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/goltan1/,avibase-0D05B12A,,,"Nova-Hispania ; Caracas, Venezuela, substituted by Hellmayr, 1936, Field Mus. Nat. Hist. Publ., Zool. Ser., 13, pt. 9, p. 106.",,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/91260#page/59/mode/1up,Tangara Arthus
