33587,species,Passeriformes,Thraupidae,Tanagers and Allies,Chalcothraupis ruficervix,"(Prévost, F; des Murs, MAPO, 1842)",Voyage autour du monde sur la frégate La Vénus commandée par Abel du Petit-Thouars Atlas pl.5 fig.1,Golden-naped Tanager,Golden-naped Tanager,,605,"Taxon fulvicervix (polytypic) is treated as conspecific with Chalcothraupis ruficervix based on available evidence. Although plumage differences between these taxa are pronounced, subspecies amabilis from the fulvicervix group shows evidence of intermediacy (Zimmer 1943b), such that differing arrangements of subspecies allocation have been proposed (e.g., Isler & Isler 1987). Genetic and vocal data would provide an additional perspective on the status of these proposed species.",,,NE,,gontan1,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/gontan1/,avibase-4B490812,,,no locality.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/101309#page/73/mode/1up,Tanagra ruficervix
