33659,species,Passeriformes,Thraupidae,Tanagers and Allies,Stilpnia cayana,"(Linnaeus, C, 1766)",Systema Naturæ. Editio duodecima reformata. Tomus I [part 1] p.315,Burnished-buff Tanager,Burnished-buff Tanager,,599,"Taxon flava (polytypic) is treated as conspecific with Stilpnia cayana based on available evidence. Although obvious plumage differences exist, geographic variation is poorly understood and intermediate phenotypes occur in areas of contact (Isler & Isler 1987). Moreover, mitochondrial DNA divergence is shallow and show discordant subspecies groupings compared to rapidly evolving nuclear DNA loci (Savit & Bates 2015).",,,NE,,bubtan2,https://birdsoftheworld.org/bow/species/bubtan2/,avibase-D9A843C8,,,Cayenne.,,https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/137337#page/319/mode/1up,Tanagra cayana
